&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here, you will have the unique opportunity to work at one of Europe’s most exciting Fintechs and directly safeguard our growth and operational integrity. You will own the end-to-end delivery of our regulatory remediation roadmap, establishing robust, BaFin-compliant preventive control frameworks (MaBeschwer, MaComp, MaRisk, KWG) and maintaining Written Orders (SfO) across all active markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting directly to the head of the department, you will have the unique opportunity to lead high-visibility regulatory initiatives, managing Test of Design (ToD) and Test of Effectiveness (ToE) milestones while driving operational strategy, scaling data quality, and guiding cross-functional teams.&lt;/p&gt;
