&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Written Order (SfO) Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain, update, and own CMP’s Written Orders, procedures, and work instructions for structural compliance, process consistency, and cross-market operational alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
