&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with agile methodologies, digital product development, and data-driven audit techniques is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in liaising with the External Regulators and Supervisory Body&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Essential requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
