&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://n26.com/en-eu/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;https://n26.com/en-eu/diversity-and-inclusion&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As our Senior Legal Counsel for Employment Law, you will be the go-to trusted advisor on both individual and collective employment law matters, ensuring compliance with local and EU regulations while supporting diversity and inclusion initiatives. This role manages negotiation strategies and leads complex works council negotiations, reviews employment related agreements, represents the company in employment disputes, and advises on employee relations issues. Additionally, it ensures proper data handling, maintains up to date knowledge of legal developments, and aligns organisational policies with legal requirements and best practices.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role you will be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Advisory:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide expert, business-oriented legal counsel on the full spectrum of individual and collective employment law—including employment contracts, compensation structures, terminations, benefits, and anti-discrimination topics.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Works Council Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead negotiation strategies and build constructive, collaborative relationships with the Works Council to co-create impactful works agreements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agreements &amp;amp; Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Review employment contracts, offer frameworks, and operational workforce templates, empowering People Operations to move fast while staying compliant.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dispute Resolution &amp;amp; Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Represent the business in employment-related disputes, proactively defending against claims while protecting our reputation and core values.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Relations Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Advise leadership and people teams on sensitive employee relations topics, from performance management and disciplinary actions to complex grievances.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Progressive Policy Design: &lt;/strong&gt;Shape internal guidelines that champion fairness and comply with local laws, EU directives, and modern Diversity, Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion (DEI) best practices.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Data Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Safeguard employee trust by ensuring workforce data handling and retention practices remain strictly compliant with GDPR and privacy standards.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Future-Proofing &amp;amp; Horizon Scanning:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay ahead of key legal developments and EU directives, translating regulatory changes into proactive, practical business advantages.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
