&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;N26 has reimagined banking for today&#39;s digital world. Technology and design empower everything we do and it&#39;s how we are building the global banking platform the world loves to use.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
