&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Founded in 2013, N26 now has 7 million customers in 24 markets. We employ more than 1700 employees across 3 office locations in Berlin, Madrid and Barcelona.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
