&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; for our Investments team to take our Wealth products to the next level. Our Investments team is dedicated to empowering retail investors by building accessible, transparent, and innovative investment products. We believe that investing should be intuitive, fair, and aligned with long-term financial success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a leader within our Product team, you’ll drive the evolution of our core investment offerings, ensuring they are best-in-class for retail investors while also being scalable, compliant, and well-integrated with partners and platforms. You&#39;ll work cross-functionally with engineering, design, business, data, compliance, and external stakeholders to build investment products that meet the needs of our customer base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires deep domain expertise—you should have a strong grasp of investment products from a retail investor’s perspective and an understanding of the ecosystem, partnerships, and infrastructure required to deliver these products at scale. You’ll need to balance customer needs, regulatory requirements, while driving execution and delivering results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute product strategy and roadmap for the team, aligning with company goals and market opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end product development for investment products, from ideation to launch and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with stakeholders across the company to build and scale investment solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze data to continuously refine product offerings and identify new opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive growth, engagement, and retention of investment products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a data-driven, customer-first culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to be successful:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Background:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product management experience, with at least 2+ years focused on investment products or wealth management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a fintech company, brokerage, robo-advisor, asset management firm, or investment platform is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with third-party partners, regulatory bodies, and financial institutions to bring investment products to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skills:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Thinker&lt;/strong&gt;: Able to craft a long-term product vision while executing effectively in the short term.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution-Focused&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong ability to ship products, drive operational excellence, and navigate complex financial ecosystems. Biased for action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Data-Driven&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong ability to interpret investment data, market trends, and user insights to inform product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomy &amp;amp; Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: Thrives in an entrepreneurial, fast-moving environment with a high level of independence and responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience working cross-functionally with engineering, compliance, legal, marketing, and finance teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: Excellent ability to articulate product decisions, drive alignment, and influence at all levels of the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory &amp;amp; Risk Acumen&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to navigate the complex regulatory landscape of investments while balancing user experience and compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bonus points if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with embedded finance, direct indexing, crypto, or alternative investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with portfolio construction, risk modeling, or tax optimization strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with investment-related APIs and integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accelerate your career growth by joining one of Europe’s most talked about disruptors 🚀.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee benefits that range from a competitive personal development budget, work from home budget, discounts to fitness &amp;amp; wellness memberships, language apps and public transportation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Come together with your team in the office for a dedicated day of teamwork each week, plus another day of your choice, and enjoy the flexibility of remote work the rest of the time. &lt;em&gt;Some roles may require additional in-office presence&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As an N26 employee you will have access to a Premium subscription on your personal N26 bank account. As well as subscriptions for friends and family members.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional day of annual leave for each year of service.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high degree of autonomy and access to cutting edge technologies - all while working with a friendly team of peers of diverse nationalities, life experiences and family statuses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A relocation package with visa support for those who need it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;N26 has reimagined banking for today’s digital world. Technology and design empower&lt;a href=&quot;https://n26.com/en-eu/blog&quot;&gt; everything we do&lt;/a&gt; and it’s how we are building the global banking platform the world loves to use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;ve eliminated physical branches, paperwork, and hidden fees for an elegant digital experience and supreme savings. Giving people the power to live and bank their way is what gets us out of bed in the morning and inspires the work that we do.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are headquartered in Berlin with offices in multiple cities across Europe, including Madrid and Barcelona, and a 1,500-strong team of more than 80 nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sounds good? Apply now for this position.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We recognize that our strength lies in our people and the varied perspectives they bring to our workforce. We strive to build talented and diverse teams to drive our business success and empower our people to reach their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We genuinely welcome and encourage applications from people of all backgrounds, cultures, genders, sexual orientations, abilities, neurodiversities, and ages. We&#39;re committed to creating an inclusive workspace where everyone feels valued and respected, free from harassment and discrimination. If there&#39;s anything you need to make the application process work for you, please let us know by reaching out to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:candidate.exp@n26.com&quot;&gt;candidate.exp@n26.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://n26.com/en-eu/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about Diversity, Equity, &amp;amp; Inclusion at N26.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Product Marketing Manager to act as the visionary owner for a major segment vertical, responsible for architecting long-term frameworks that align global customer needs with market-defining value propositions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Senior Product Marketing team steers product evolution and global GTM standards to maximize adoption and ecosystem loyalty, and believes in using deep analytical rigor and strong cross-functional leadership to define the voice of the customer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will serve as the primary strategic bridge between Executive, Product, and Operations teams, ensuring that every launch delivers significant commercial impact and a differentiated competitive edge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the Marketing Owner and visionary lead for a major segment vertical, accountable for the long-term strategic framework that aligns global JTBD with a market-defining Value Proposition, while steering the Product Offering evolution and global GTM standards to maximize Product Adoption and ecosystem lock-in&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the lifecycle team to foster ongoing customer education, deepen continuous product adoption, and maximize long-term user retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft compelling, consumer-centric value propositions and tailored messaging that clearly differentiate our products within the highly competitive fintech landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement impactful GTM strategies for new product features and launches, ensuring flawless cross-channel execution and significant user acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, monitor, and analyze key performance metrics for all product launches, proactively adjusting marketing plans to meet or exceed adoption targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the voice of the customer by leveraging market research, competitive analysis, and UX feedback to uncover market fit opportunities and refine product narratives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the brand and creative teams to maintain a consistent voice, tone, and high-quality creative standard across all marketing channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the strategic bridge between product, business operations, and marketing, aligning stakeholders on priorities and ensuring seamless communication and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to be successful:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Background:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience within the Product Marketing space ideally in a tech driven company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Marketing, Communications, Business, or Commerce with relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Skills:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience leading end-to-end Go-to-Market strategies, serving as the critical bridge between Product, Marketing, and Operations to ensure seamless, high-impact launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of driving product acquisition, user growth, and retention through strategic lifecycle initiatives and in-product growth levers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert at crafting customer centric value propositions and differentiated messaging that effectively positions products within the competitive fintech or tech landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at synthesizing market research, UX insights, and competitive analysis to inform strategy, while maintaining a strong understanding of tech-driven ecosystems and regulatory requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced stakeholder influence and collaboration through building cross functional partnerships and influencing decisions across Product, Marketing, and Business teams in fast paced environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced growth mindset with a proactive, high-ownership mentality with bias for action and a commitment to a &quot;test, learn, and optimize&quot; approach based on data insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Accelerate your career growth by joining one of Europe’s most talked about disruptors 🚀.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Employee benefits that range from a competitive personal development budget, work from home budget, discounts to fitness &amp;amp; wellness memberships, language apps and public transportation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;As an N26 employee you will have access to a Premium subscription on your personal N26 bank account. As well as subscriptions for friends and family members.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Additional day of annual leave for each year of service.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;A high degree of autonomy and access to cutting edge technologies - all while working with a friendly team of peers of diverse nationalities, experiences, and backgrounds.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;A relocation package with visa support for those who need it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
