&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Manager HVM – German&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we are driven to empower small businesses across the globe by de-hassling their lives and helping them to succeed. Our vision as a global FinTech company is to build the first-ever global card acceptance brand, and we are well on our way as small businesses in over 33 countries around the world rely on SumUp to get paid. To get there, we are putting together an awesome team that is committed to one another and to our merchants. You could be our missing link! Help us bring card acceptance to the masses!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an account manager, you will be responsible for managing the full merchant lifecycle of our high-value merchants (monthly TPV &amp;gt; €50), providing personalized, high-touch support from onboarding to retention and growth. You will act as the single point of contact for your assigned portfolio of merchants, proactively engaging with them to maximize their success with SumUp while developing strong relationships that drive business value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting merchant discovery calls, understanding their needs from the moment they sign up and ensuring a smooth and frictionless activation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering tailored training sessions on SumUp products either remotely or onsite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with our field sales team during deal closure to ensure a seamless transition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serving as the primary relationship manager, ensuring high-value merchants receive priority support and proactively providing strategic consultations to merchants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring transactional data and key account metrics, identifying opportunities for growth or signs of potential churn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upselling and cross-selling relevant SumUp products to drive merchant expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaising with internal teams to resolve merchant pain points effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Activation, retention and growth of the portfolio of merchants through:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive activation reach out calls to engage the merchants and get them to start transacting per necessary product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting personalized training sessions, either onsite or through Google Meets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keeping merchants engaged and satisfied with our products and helping them reach their expected TPV targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting proactive retention activities, identifying early signs of churn and implementing strategies to re-engage at-risk merchants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executing ad-hoc growth campaigns aimed at increasing merchant engagement and driving additional revenue opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 to 3 years of experience in managing large accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sales and upselling capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in English and German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in data analysis and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and the ability to think creatively to find solutions to client issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competent up to date knowledge of market (i.e retail, FnB verticals)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Barcelona office. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🥗Restaurant tickets (powered by Edenred)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: Be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for attending conferences and/or advancing your career through further education&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔄 30 Days Sabbatical: Enjoy the unique opportunity to take a well-deserved break with our 30 days sabbatical benefit after completing 3 years of employment with SumUp&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: Earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;About SumUp&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in the everyday hero. Small business owners are at the heart of all we do, so we&#39;re creating tools that help them run their businesses. With a founder’s mentality and a &#39;team-first&#39; attitude, our diverse teams across Europe, South America, and the United States work together to ensure that the small business owners we partner with can be successful doing what they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer that proudly pursues and hires a diverse workforce. SumUp does not make hiring or employment decisions on the basis of race, color, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. SumUp also strives for a healthy and safe workplace and strictly prohibits harassment of any kind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp will not accept unsolicited resumes from any source other than directly from a candidate.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Account Executive&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Newcastle, United Kingdom&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Team description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is growing its sales presence in Newcastle, helping local shops, cafés and businesses find payment solutions that fit their needs. As one of our first Account Executives in the region, you&#39;ll own your pipeline, win new business and build relationships with merchants across the North East.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines outbound sales with face-to-face customer meetings, giving you the independence to develop your territory while working closely with our London team. And as an Official Training Kit Partner of Newcastle United, you&#39;ll also have opportunities to use matchday experiences to connect with local merchants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Generate new business through outbound calls, emails, social outreach and face-to-face meetings&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the full sales cycle, from prospecting and product demonstrations to negotiation and closing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build relationships with local merchants, understanding their needs and recommending the right SumUp solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop your own pipeline and identify new opportunities across Newcastle and the surrounding area&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use our Newcastle United partnership, including opportunities to invite merchants to matches, to strengthen commercial relationships&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage your targets and pipeline while collaborating with our wider London sales team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1–2 years of outbound B2B sales or business development experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Confidence generating your own opportunities and closing new business&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong communication skills and the ability to build relationships with business owners&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfortable combining phone-based prospecting with in-person customer meetings&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Independence, commercial curiosity and a results-driven mindset&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus:&lt;/strong&gt; Previous field sales experience or exposure to payments, fintech, SaaS or hospitality&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How you&#39;ll work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3 days in the field:&lt;/strong&gt; Meeting merchants and developing business across Newcastle&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1 day from home:&lt;/strong&gt; Prospecting, managing your pipeline and following up with customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1 day in London:&lt;/strong&gt; Working alongside our sales team, with travel expenses covered&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Initial onboarding will take place in London for approximately 1–2 weeks, with expenses covered by SumUp.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🎉 Why you should join SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💸 &lt;strong&gt;Competitive compensation:&lt;/strong&gt; £40,000–£50,000 base salary + £27,000 target commission, uncapped&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⚽ &lt;strong&gt;Newcastle United partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Access to matchday experiences and opportunities to invite merchants&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Territory ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Be one of our first Account Executives in Newcastle and help grow our regional presence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍 &lt;strong&gt;Global opportunities:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with SumUppers across different markets and help businesses access fintech solutions used by millions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 &lt;strong&gt;Learning budget:&lt;/strong&gt; €2,000 annually to invest in your professional development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 &lt;strong&gt;Break4me:&lt;/strong&gt; 30-day sabbatical after 3 years&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;Referral bonus:&lt;/strong&gt; Earn rewards for referring talented people&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 &lt;strong&gt;Diversity and inclusion:&lt;/strong&gt; Join a workplace that values different perspectives and backgrounds&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🤔 About SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 39 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt;our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 4,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot;&gt;TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agente di commercio / Procacciatore (P. IVA) – Settore pagamenti&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le informazioni principali&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Territorio:&lt;/strong&gt; Lazio, principali città e province&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attività:&lt;/strong&gt; vendita diretta sul territorio a negozi, ristoranti, professionisti e piccole imprese&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sviluppo clienti:&lt;/strong&gt; presenza sul territorio, contatto diretto con le attività locali, relazioni e passaparola; eventuali appuntamenti forniti dal team SDR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inquadramento:&lt;/strong&gt; mandato da agente di commercio o procacciatore d’affari diretto SumUp con Partita IVA, anche plurimandatario non in competizione diretta.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compenso:&lt;/strong&gt; provvigioni sulle vendite e commissioni mensili ricorrenti sul transato, senza tetto massimo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fisso mensile:&lt;/strong&gt; non previsto&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Obiettivo:&lt;/strong&gt; costruire nel tempo un portafoglio di clienti attivi capace di generare compensi ricorrenti&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supporto:&lt;/strong&gt; formazione iniziale online e affiancamenti sul territorio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Per sviluppare la rete commerciale SumUp nel Lazio cerchiamo agenti di commercio e procacciatori d’affari abituati a creare nuove opportunità sul campo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;È un’attività commerciale autonoma e prevalentemente in presenza. Il compenso è legato ai risultati: comprende provvigioni sulle nuove vendite e commissioni ricorrenti generate dal transato dei clienti acquisiti.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La tua giornata sul territorio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il lavoro si svolge principalmente sul campo. Ogni giorno organizzerai in autonomia agenda e zona di attività, incontrando commercianti e professionisti per comprendere come gestiscono oggi i pagamenti e presentare soluzioni adatte alle loro esigenze.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nel concreto:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;selezionerai le aree e le attività commerciali su cui concentrare la giornata;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;incontrerai negozianti, ristoratori, professionisti e titolari di piccole imprese, creando nuove relazioni commerciali anche attraverso contatti locali e passaparola;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ascolterai le esigenze del commerciante e valuterai insieme a lui come rendere più semplice la gestione dei pagamenti;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;mostrerai in modo pratico le soluzioni SumUp, spiegandone i benefici concreti: semplicità di utilizzo, rapidità di attivazione, meno stress operativo e possibilità di risparmio;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;accompagnerai il cliente dalla prima conversazione alla scelta della soluzione e all’attivazione, con un processo rapido e digitale;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;pianificherai richiami e visite successive, registrando le opportunità nello strumento digitale Sidekick;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;coltiverai le relazioni con i clienti acquisiti per sviluppare il portafoglio e generare nuove segnalazioni;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;gestirai anche eventuali appuntamenti o contatti qualificati provenienti dal team SDR interno, quando disponibili.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Per avere successo servono presenza costante sul territorio, capacità di creare relazioni e continuità nei richiami. L’obiettivo non è soltanto concludere una singola vendita, ma costruire nel tempo una base di clienti attivi capace di generare &lt;strong&gt;commissioni ricorrenti stabili legate al transato&lt;/strong&gt;. Gli appuntamenti del team SDR sono un supporto aggiuntivo; lo sviluppo del portafoglio nasce soprattutto dall’iniziativa e dalle relazioni dell’agente.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cosa guadagni&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il piano provvigionale è legato ai risultati e non prevede un tetto massimo:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;50% di provvigione diretta&lt;/strong&gt; sul valore di ogni prodotto venduto, inclusi POS, hardware e software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commissione sul transato del primo anno&lt;/strong&gt;, calcolata sui ricavi netti generati dai clienti acquisiti.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provvigione mensile ricorrente sui ricavi netti:&lt;/strong&gt; mentre continui ad acquisire nuovi clienti, il portafoglio già sviluppato può continuare a generare compensi in base al transato.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Secondo i risultati della rete commerciale attiva:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;nei primi mesi, gli agenti attivi guadagnano mediamente &lt;strong&gt;€3.000–€4.000 lordi al mese&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;con un portafoglio consolidato, la media può superare &lt;strong&gt;€5.000 lordi al mese&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;il 20% degli agenti con i risultati più alti supera &lt;strong&gt;€13.000 lordi al mese&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I compensi indicati non sono garantiti: dipendono dall’attività svolta, dalle vendite concluse, dal transato dei clienti e dalle condizioni del piano provvigionale, illustrate durante il colloquio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chi cerchiamo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professionisti con esperienza nella vendita diretta sul territorio, preferibilmente B2B, PMI, retail o HORECA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agenti provenienti anche da energia, telecomunicazioni, assicurazioni, servizi digitali o altri settori rivolti agli esercenti.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Persone abituate a creare autonomamente nuove opportunità commerciali e a sviluppare relazioni con continuità e metodo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partita IVA attiva oppure disponibilità concreta ad aprirla prima dell’avvio dell’attività.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomia nell’organizzazione dell’agenda e forte orientamento agli obiettivi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dimestichezza con smartphone e strumenti digitali.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Presenza stabile e disponibilità a muoversi nella zona assegnata nel Lazio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Un portafoglio di contatti locali nel retail o nell’HORECA costituisce un vantaggio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Questa opportunità non è adatta a chi cerca&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;un contratto di lavoro dipendente;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;uno stipendio fisso o un compenso minimo garantito;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;un ruolo esclusivamente da remoto o di vendita telefonica;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;un’attività basata soltanto su appuntamenti forniti dall’azienda.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Il supporto SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formazione iniziale online sui prodotti e sul metodo commerciale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Affiancamenti sul territorio con il team di riferimento.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mandato diretto e supporto di un marchio riconosciuto nel settore dei pagamenti.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attivazione digitale e rapida dei clienti, con burocrazia ridotta.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Se ti riconosci in un modello di vendita autonomo, concreto e orientato ai risultati, candidati.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SumUp promuove pari opportunità e valuta le candidature nel rispetto delle diversità e delle competenze professionali.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Parole chiave: Agente di commercio; Procacciatore d’affari; Procacciatore; Rappresentante commerciale; Consulente commerciale; Sales Representative; Sales Executive; Business Developer; BDR; Partita IVA; P. IVA; Enasarco; Plurimandatario; POS; Terminale POS; Lettore carte; Pagamenti digitali; Pagamenti elettronici; Merchant services; Acquiring; Soluzioni di pagamento; Servizi per esercenti; Retail; Ristorazione; HORECA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

