&lt;p&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 and 10 paid days of educational leave which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖 Generous time off: 25 days of paid leave, plus one extra day per year of service (up to 35), along with public holidays and special leave options&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏥 Peace of mind: additional health insurance and life insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
