&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a small team of sales excellence specialists, taking on the most complex initiatives personally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience leading sales operations, commercial operations, revenue operations or a similar function at a senior level, ideally including people leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of partnering with senior Sales leaders to shape channel strategy and turn business priorities into clear, actionable goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong skills in commercial performance analysis, able to read funnel, revenue and productivity data and translate it into practical recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence influencing senior stakeholders across Sales, Product, Marketing and Finance without relying on direct authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working through ambiguity while leading complex, cross functional programmes from strategy through to execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice to have: fluency in French, German, Spanish or Italian.&lt;/p&gt;
