&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Barcelona, Spain (office-first, with regular time in the field across Spain and Portugal) &lt;strong&gt;Contract:&lt;/strong&gt; 1 year fixed term with a view to going permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q5xfa9S2Fmg&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Barcelona office tour&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Spain and Portugal are still early in their field sales journey, and this role exists to take them out of incubation and into a strong, self-sustaining growth phase. You&#39;ll build and lead the regional management structure from the ground up, shaping how up to six regional managers, their territory managers and self-employed consultants sell SumUp&#39;s products to small businesses on the ground. It&#39;s a rare chance to design a sales organisation almost from scratch, with a direct line to shaping how SumUp wins two of its most important growth markets in Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and lead a founding team of regional managers across Spain and Portugal, setting the standard for how the channel operates&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive sales execution and revenue growth in line with the regional business plan, while protecting profit margins&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design career trajectories and performance management for a channel built largely on self-employed consultants&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with regional managers and territory managers through joint field visits, coaching and regular team touchpoints&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Track and act on key sales metrics, including quota attainment, sales cycle length and customer retention, feeding insights back to wider stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience leading field sales managers, ideally within merchant services or a comparable in-market sales environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong track record of building and scaling sales teams from an early or incubation stage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfort working with self-employed consultant models and the unique motivation and retention challenges they bring.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to translate a business plan into clear performance targets and day-to-day sales execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the confidence to coach, challenge and align a distributed field team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
