&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 Inbound Sales Representative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;📍Milano, on-site&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to take the next step in your sales career with one of Europe’s leading fintech scale-ups?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our inbound sales team in &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, where you’ll turn warm leads into customers — and make sure those customers successfully get started with SumUp.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At &lt;strong&gt;SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;, we believe small businesses are the heart of the economy. That’s why we build intuitive, affordable tools that make running a business simpler. With millions of businesses using SumUp across Europe and beyond, we’re helping merchants get paid, manage their businesses and grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;Inbound Sales Representative&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll own the customer journey from the first conversation through to closing the deal and successful activation. You’ll use a consultative approach to understand each merchant’s needs, recommend the right SumUp solutions, and make sure they get up and running.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎯 What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Convert inbound leads into customers&lt;/strong&gt; by understanding merchant needs, running engaging product conversations and closing deals through phone and video call.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own customer activation after the sale&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring your impact goes beyond closing the deal: true sales success comes from activating merchants and driving the adoption and usage of SumUp solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage your pipeline and performance&lt;/strong&gt;, using Salesforce and data to prioritise opportunities, follow up effectively and continuously improve conversion and activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build strong customer relationships&lt;/strong&gt; and work closely with Acquisition, Onboarding and Operations to create a smooth journey from lead to active customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Share customer insights and requirements&lt;/strong&gt; to help improve our sales and activation motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👀 You’ll Be a Great Fit If You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience in &lt;strong&gt;sales, account management, or a similar commercial/customer-facing role&lt;/strong&gt;, with a track record of delivering measurable results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are confident &lt;strong&gt;building relationships, understanding customer needs and influencing buying decisions&lt;/strong&gt; — including closing commercial conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are organised and comfortable managing multiple customers or opportunities while taking ownership of your results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are commercially minded and understand that &lt;strong&gt;winning the customer is only the first step — successful activation matters too&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working with CRM systems and data, and thrive in a fast-paced environment where you’re expected to take ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are fluent in &lt;strong&gt;Italian and English&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌟 Why you should join SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with a truly global, multicultural team from our inspiring Milan location. This involves an office-first setup &lt;br&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced &lt;br&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education &lt;br&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 22 days of annual paid leave, 32 hours of Ex Festività (Personal Hours), plus public holidays and special leave days &lt;br&gt;💼 Financial security: corporate pension contributions that support your long-term future &lt;br&gt;❤ Well-being support: access our mental health Employee Assistance Programme for guidance and care when you need it &lt;br&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service &lt;br&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤔 About SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 38 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in&lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt; our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset.&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt; Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt; careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot;&gt; TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;Iskusni terenski prodajni savjetnik&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samostalni | Samo na proviziju | Lokalno terensko prodajno područje | 100.000 € + potencijal&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O ulozi&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tražimo iskusne terenske prodavače koji se ne ustručavaju ući u tvrtku, započeti razgovor s vlasnikom i pridobiti novog trgovca.Kao samozaposleni terenski prodajni savjetnik, prodavat ćete SumUpov-a rješenja za plaćanje, POS i softver malim i srednjim poduzećima u vašem lokalnom području. Pronalazit ćete vlastite potencijalne klijente, upravljati svojim prodajnim procesom i podržavati klijente u njihovim početcima..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Potrebno vam je iskustvo u hladnom kontaktiranju potencijalnih klijenata i spremnost da svaki tjedan provodite vrijeme na terenu. Upravljat ćete vlastitim aktivnostima, uz obuku i podršku tvrtke SumUp. Što ćete raditi?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pronalazak novih klijenata od vrata do vrata, telefonskim putem te slanjem e-mailova.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fokus na lokalna poduzeća s velikim obujmom plaćanja kojima bi koristili SumUpovi proizvodi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Postavljanje pitanja o načinu rada svakog poduzeća i preporučivanje odgovarajućih rješenja za plaćanje, obradu kartica, hardver, POS i softver.Što tražimo?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Upravljajte prodajom od prvog razgovora, preko demonstracija proizvoda, rješavanja prigovora i zaključivanja prodaje.&lt;br&gt;Pomažite korisnicima pri postavljanju i početku korištenja njihovih SumUp proizvoda.&lt;br&gt;Gradite odnose s vlasnicima tvrtki i tražite preporuke od zadovoljnih korisnika.&lt;br&gt;Planirajte svoje posjete i&amp;nbsp; kontakte kako biste najbolje iskoristili svoje vrijeme na terenu.&lt;br&gt;Ažurirajte svoje CRM zapise i pratite svoju aktivnost, prodajni proces i prodajne rezultate.&lt;br&gt;Pregledavajte napredak sa svojim terenskim menadžerom i primjenjujte povratne informacije u praksi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Osnovno&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Najmanje jedna godina iskustva u terenskoj prodaji u sektorima kao što su telekomunikacije, energetika, poslovna tehnologija, sigurnosni sustavi ili opskrba hranom i pićem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Iskustvo u aktivnom pronalaženju novih klijenata, uključujući osobni kontakt s tvrtkama i pronalaženje vlastitih potencijalnih klijenata.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Iskustvo u prodaji malim i srednjim poduzećima i izravnom kontaktu s vlasnicima ili donositeljima odluka.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dokazani uspjesi u osvajanju novih klijenata i ostvarivanju prodajnih ciljeva.Poželjno?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tražit ćemo od vas primjere onoga što ste postigli i kako.&lt;br&gt;Sposobnost vođenja prodaje od prvog kontakta do zaključenja posla, uključujući rješavanje pitanja i prigovora.&lt;br&gt;Dobra organiziranost i dosljedno praćenje.&lt;br&gt;Sposobnost nošenja s odbijanjem, učenjem iz povratnih informacija i ustrajanjem.&lt;br&gt;Razumijevanje samozapošljavanja i spremnost na ulaganje vremena potrebnog za izgradnju baze klijenata.&lt;br&gt;Mjesto stanovanja u blizini dogovorenog teritorija kako biste mogli redovito posjećivati potencijalne i postojeće klijente.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Postojeća mreža lokalnih vlasnika tvrtki kojima bi mogli koristiti SumUpovi proizvodi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Iskustvo u području plaćanja, usluga za trgovce, POS-a ili EPOS-a.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Iskustvo u prodaji putem telefona je korisno, ali morate imati i iskustvo prodaje licem u lice na terenu.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zarada&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ovo je prilika za samozaposlenost isključivo na proviziju, bez osnovne plaće. Zarada nema gornju granicu i ovisi o vašim individualnim prodajnim rezultatima.Paket provizija naveden u ovom nacrtu uključuje:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Plaćanja: 50 % neto prihoda od godišnjih plaćanja.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hardver: 50 % prihoda od prodaje hardvera.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Softver: 50 % godišnjeg prihoda od softvera.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pasivni prihod: 20 % neto prihoda tvrtke SumUp, isplaćuje se mjesečno do dvije godine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Poticaj za nove partnere: tri puta veći uobičajeni pasivni prihod tijekom prva tri mjeseca.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dodatni bonusi za ostvarene ciljeve.Napomena za izradu: potvrdite primjenjive uvjete provizije i poticaje za svako tržište prije objave.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Obuka i podrška&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pomoći ćemo vam da upoznate proizvode i naučite kako ih prodavati, s uvođenjem u posao i kontinuiranom podrškom koja pokriva pronalaženje potencijalnih klijenata, prodajne razgovore, demonstracije, prigovore i uvođenje klijenata.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vaš teritorijalni menadžer također će vam pružiti podršku u planiranju teritorija, &lt;em&gt;pregledima prodajnih cijevi i coachingom na terenu.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Prodaja, Korisnička podrška, Terenski prodajni predstavnik, Terenska prodaja, Prodajni predstavnik, Prodajni izvršni djelatnik, Samostalni poduzetnik, Prodajni asistent, Voditelj prodajnih računa, Voditelj prodajnih računa, Voditelj prodaje, Prodaja automobila, Maloprodaja, Prodaja od vrata do vrata&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h1 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Key Account Sales Executive – Paris (Office-first)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-lfile-container=&quot;61d171d5-b814-4e82-b6c7-fbf6810c9455&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paris (Office-first)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;team-description-1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp already powers over 4 million businesses worldwide. We&#39;re now aiming for bigger names, and we&#39;re building the team to do it. In France, our Key Account Sales team goes after larger businesses, from hospitality groups to beauty chains and major retailers. You&#39;ll choose how you prospect, by phone or in the field, get into their networks and close the deals. As one of the first people on this new team, you&#39;ll help work out what it takes to win these accounts, with plenty of opportunities opening up as we grow. The best part? Your variable pay is uncapped, so there&#39;s no ceiling on what you can earn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;what-youll-do-1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify and reach high-potential businesses, such as hospitality groups, beauty chains and major retailers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run high-volume outreach by phone, in the field and through other channels&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get in front of decision-makers and understand how their business and sites operate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Book meetings and run tailored pitches and demos that show how SumUp can support their business&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the full sales cycle, from first contact through to closing the deal&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grow your portfolio and network over time, using each win to open the next door&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Track your performance against targets and use feedback and data to keep improving&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;what-were-looking-for-1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in outbound sales, with a track record of hitting targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with high volumes of outreach, by phone or in the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real drive and resilience: you stay motivated when deals take time or doors stay closed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence and the ability to build strong relationships with business owners and decision-makers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with having freedom in how you work, alongside hands-on coaching and support from your team lead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in French and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;why-you-should-join-sumup-1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 Uncapped variable pay: strong performance can significantly increase your earnings&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with a truly global, multicultural team from our Paris location. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2,000 for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💼 Financial security: corporate pension contributions that support your long-term future&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏥 Healthcare support: we cover 50% of the monthly cost of your health insurance for your Mutuelle and Prévoyance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚌 Extra allowances: we offer restaurant tickets (Swile) and cover transportation costs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
