&lt;li&gt;🏖 Tiempo libre generoso: 20 días de vacaciones pagadas, más días festivos y licencias especiales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏥 Cobertura de salud y vida: en asociación con Zurich, ofrecemos seguro médico que incluye óptica, dental y seguro de vida&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💻 Beneficios adicionales: apoyo libre de impuestos para alimentación, transporte e internet en casa&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1 mes de sabbatical después de 3 años de servicio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔗 Bono de referidos: gana recompensas adicionales al referir talentos al equipo de SumUp&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Si te apasiona la tecnología, las ventas, liderar equipos de alto desempeño y estás interesado en integrarte a una empresa en donde tendrás oportunidades de aprendizaje constante,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;¡Te esperamos!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;Líder de Parcerias e Integrações&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Descrição do time&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A SumUp Brasil está expandindo as formas de aquisição de lojistas para além dos nossos canais tradicionais. Parcerias com provedores de TEF, ERPs e plataformas de software comercial representam uma oportunidade de alto potencial para levar os pagamentos para dentro das ferramentas que os lojistas já utilizam. Nessa posição, você será responsável por construir esse canal do zero no mercado brasileiro, aproveitando a experiência da SumUp na Europa e adaptando a às necessidades locais.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;O que você vai fazer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construir o ecossistema: identificar e priorizar parceiros com alto potencial, desenvolvendo um pipeline de ERPs, provedores de TEF e outros softwares relevantes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liderar da estratégia ao lançamento: estruturar propostas de parceria, conduzir discussões e negociações comerciais e criar planos conjuntos de GTM (go to market)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fazer as integrações acontecerem: trabalhar em conjunto com Product &amp;amp; Engineering, Legal, Finance e outras áreas para levar as parcerias da etapa de avaliação até o lançamento e crescimento&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impulsionar a performance do canal: acompanhar aquisição e ativação de lojistas, além do volume transacionado, utilizando os resultados para ajustar prioridades e execução&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construir para escalar: documentar decisões e criar playbooks que tornem as parcerias bem sucedidas replicáveis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Você será uma ótima pessoa para essa posição se…&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Já construiu ou escalou parcerias comerciais, business development ou canais de aquisição&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tem mais de 3 anos de experiência com plataformas de software e o ecossistema de pagamentos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consegue conectar integrações a resultados comerciais e trabalhar de forma próxima a Product e Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tem perfil empreendedor e analítico e se sente confortável criando estrutura em ambientes ambíguos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consegue alinhar times internos e parceiros externos, mesmo sem autoridade formal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tem inglês intermediário a avançado e se comunica com confiança com stakeholders globais&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Por que você deve se juntar à SumUp&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Oportunidade de trabalhar com um time verdadeiramente global e multicultural no nosso dinâmico hub de São Paulo, no coração da cidade. Esse modelo é presencial&lt;br&gt;🌈 Compromisso com Diversidade e Inclusão: faça parte de um ambiente de trabalho que valoriza e promove a diversidade, cultivando um ambiente inclusivo onde as perspectivas de todos são respeitadas e acolhidas&lt;br&gt;🚀 Participação no nosso programa de Virtual Stock Options: você terá uma participação no sucesso futuro da SumUp&lt;br&gt;📚 Um orçamento anual dedicado de R$ 10.000 para educação, certificações e conferências&lt;br&gt;🏖 Tempo livre generoso: aproveite 22 dias úteis de licença remunerada, além de feriados e dias especiais de licença&lt;br&gt;💪 Mantenha se em forma: inclui plano Wellhub e academia no escritório&lt;br&gt;💼 Bem estar financeiro: a SumUp contribui para o seu plano de previdência privada com o Santander&lt;br&gt;🧠 Bem estar mental: acesso ao Zenklub para terapia, coaching e recursos de bem estar emocional&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Sobre a SumUp&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Seja empoderado a fazer mais do que importa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Na SumUp, nossa missão é empoderar pequenos negócios em todo o mundo, oferecendo ferramentas simples e acessíveis que permitem que eles prosperem. Hoje, mais de 4 milhões de negócios em 39 mercados confiam na SumUp como parceira financeira para gerenciar pagamentos, finanças e relacionamento com clientes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nosso compromisso com os pequenos negócios se reflete no &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt;nosso time diverso&lt;/a&gt; de mais de 4.000 SumUppers de mais de 90 nacionalidades, unidos pela colaboração global e por uma mentalidade inovadora. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;Nossos valores centrais&lt;/a&gt; são a base de quem somos e do que defendemos, moldando nossa cultura de trabalho e impulsionando nosso sucesso. Cultivamos a inclusão e uma cultura de aprendizado contínuo, oferecendo um espaço seguro para o crescimento pessoal e profissional. Nossas diferenças nos tornam únicos e fortes, à medida que buscamos criar um ambiente onde todos pertencem e se sentem apoiados, independentemente de como se identificam.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A SumUp tem orgulho de ser uma empregadora que promove a Igualdade de Oportunidades no Emprego, buscando e abraçando ativamente a diversidade em nossa força de trabalho. Não tomamos decisões de contratação ou emprego com base em raça, cor, religião ou crença religiosa, origem étnica ou nacional, nacionalidade, sexo, gênero, identidade de gênero, orientação sexual, deficiência, idade ou qualquer outra base protegida pelas leis aplicáveis ou proibida pela política da empresa. Nosso compromisso vai além do recrutamento, buscando criar um ambiente de trabalho seguro e respeitoso, onde qualquer forma de assédio é estritamente proibida. Descubra mais sobre nossa cultura e oportunidades em nosso &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt;site de carreiras&lt;/a&gt;, e acompanhe nossa jornada no &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; e &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot;&gt;TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Team description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll keep our warehouses and transport network across the US and Canada running smoothly, so the right stock is in the right place at the right time. This role has real room to make a difference: you&#39;ll raise inventory accuracy, move our returns process into our warehouse management and SAP systems, and take full ownership of how our logistics providers perform. If you enjoy digging into data, finding the root cause of a problem and seeing your fix change how a whole region works, this role gives you the scope and the trust to do it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎥 Take a look inside our &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8LwAYCUtfXQ&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;São Paulo office&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run daily warehouse and transport performance for the US and Canada, spotting risks and bottlenecks early and fixing them before they affect customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead improvement projects of medium to high complexity, including automating the returns flow in our warehouse management and SAP systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track the measures that matter, such as cost, lead time, inventory accuracy, on time and in full delivery, and service level, then dig into the root cause when one slips&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own provider performance and governance, and manage import and export flows for inventory transfers and supplier deliveries in line with regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the procurement process from request to order, balancing speed, cost and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English, written and spoken, makes it easy to work with teams and stakeholders in different regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem solving skills help in finding root causes and putting practical fixes in place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of Excel, SQL and Power BI or Tableau, with experience in warehouse and transport management systems and the ability to build an analysis from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort making decisions based on data and using metrics to keep improving how things run.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to juggle several stakeholders, prioritise competing requests and stay hands on, while helping teammates grow their own skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with a truly global, multicultural team from our dynamic São Paulo hub in the heart of the city. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of R$ 10,000 for education, certifications, and conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏖️ Generous time off: enjoy 22 working days of paid leave, plus public holidays and special leave days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💪 Stay fit: Wellhub membership included and gym at the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💼 Financial wellness: SumUp contributes to your private retirement plan with Santander&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🧠 Mental well-being: access to Zenklub for therapy, coaching, and emotional wellness resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🍽 Meal support: benefit from a tax-free food voucher program with Pluxee&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 39 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 4,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
