&lt;h2&gt;Team description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the designated Money Laundering Reporting Officer for our Chilean regulated entity, you&#39;ll be the local expert on preventing money laundering and terrorist financing, and the main contact for regulators in Chile. You&#39;ll make the call on suspicious activity reports, check that our controls work, and raise material risks directly with local senior management, while working as part of our global anti-money laundering assurance team. Chilean regulation requires this role, and your judgement will help protect the licence that lets small businesses in Chile use SumUp, so it suits someone who wants real accountability and visible influence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead compliance with Chilean anti-money laundering and counter-terrorist financing regulation and oversee how well the local framework works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decide on suspicious activity escalations and make sure reports reach the regulator on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess local money laundering and terrorist financing risks, including risks from new products or changes to business activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor how well controls work, from customer checks to transaction monitoring, and report material risks and fixes to local management and governance bodies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the main contact for Chilean regulators and support regulatory inspections and audits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a Money Laundering Reporting Officer or Deputy in Chilean financial services, ideally in fintech, payments, electronic money or banking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of Chilean anti-money laundering and counter-terrorist financing regulation and law enforcement reporting requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience reviewing transaction monitoring alerts, assessing complex cases and handling high risk escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of payments, merchant acquiring, small business risk profiles and online financial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ethical standards and the ability to make high stakes decisions with confidence, balance commercial priorities with regulatory duties, and explain technical concepts clearly to regulators, senior leaders and colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to speak English fluently with various stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌍 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Santiago office. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp’s future success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget that you can use to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏖️ Generous time off: 20 days of paid leave, plus public holidays and special leave days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏥 Health and life coverage: in partnership with Zurich, we offer health insurance, including optical and dental and life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💻 Extra allowances: tax-free support for meals, childcare, transportation, and home internet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 39 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt;our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 4,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot;&gt;TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employer brand video library:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/sumup/Global-Employer-Brand-video-library-Empowering-Talent-Acquisition-partners-and-hiring-managers-194d3d97eb3c4eaca7ee2edff1a9d3fd&quot;&gt;Global Employer Brand video library&lt;/a&gt; has videos you can add to the job post or use in LinkedIn posts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

