&lt;h1&gt;Outside Sales Senior Account Executive&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Chicago, IL&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp’s Field Sales team is on the ground, expanding into new markets across the country and building real relationships with the small and medium-sized businesses that power local communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every day, our team meets merchants face-to-face, helping them discover payment and loyalty solutions that can make running and growing their businesses easier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Outside Sales Senior Account Executive, you’ll take ownership of your territory, manage the full sales cycle, and become a trusted face of SumUp for the merchants you serve. With the support of your Team Lead and Regional Manager, you’ll have the autonomy to build your pipeline, close new business, and grow your earnings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by results, enjoy connecting with people, and want uncapped earning potential with a clear path for career growth, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own your territory by building and managing a strong sales pipeline through prospecting, canvassing, referrals, and relationships with local businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the full sales cycle from cold outreach and door-to-door prospecting through discovery, product demonstrations, negotiation, and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build meaningful merchant relationships by understanding each business, identifying its needs, and recommending the right SumUp solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work strategically by researching your territory, identifying high-potential opportunities, and prioritizing your time effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay on top of your pipeline using Salesforce to track activity, manage opportunities, and maintain clear and consistent follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a local ambassador for SumUp by confidently representing our payment and loyalty solutions and showing merchants how SumUp can help their businesses thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great if the following describes you…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates &lt;strong&gt;must have prior sales experience in&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;fintech, payment processing, or point-of-sale (POS) solutions&lt;/strong&gt;. This is a &lt;strong&gt;required qualification&lt;/strong&gt;, not a preferred one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working independently in a field-based, territory-driven sales environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can connect with people quickly, ask the right questions, listen carefully, and adapt your approach to each merchant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable with cold outreach and face-to-face prospecting, including visiting local businesses within your territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a valid driver’s license and reliable transportation to travel throughout your assigned territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are self-motivated, resilient, and results-driven, with the ambition to grow your skills, your career, and your earning potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍 &lt;strong&gt;Make an impact at a global fintech &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with SumUppers around the world on large scale fintech products that help millions of businesses succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💼 &lt;strong&gt;US based Customer Experience team&lt;/strong&gt; in Texas that can support both English and Spanish speaking merchants&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 &lt;strong&gt;Invest in your growth &lt;/strong&gt;Receive a $2,000 annual learning and development budget to build new skills and support your career development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖 &lt;strong&gt;Take time to recharge &lt;/strong&gt;Enjoy 22 days of paid vacation, 8 sick days, public holidays, quarterly wellness days, and additional special leave.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏥 &lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive health and protection benefits &lt;/strong&gt;Access medical, dental, and vision coverage through Cigna and Kaiser, along with life insurance and disability coverage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Build your financial future &lt;/strong&gt;Participate in our 401(k) retirement plan with SumUp matching&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Compensation&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Uncapped earning potential&lt;/strong&gt; Earn $129,800 in on target earnings (OTE), including a $65,000 base salary, with uncapped commission and no ceiling on your earning potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📈 &lt;strong&gt;Grow your career and your earnings&lt;/strong&gt; Take advantage of clear opportunities for career advancement and increased compensation, with growth directly tied to your performance and impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower merchants&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 38 countries rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt;our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 4,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot;&gt;TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#SumUpUSA&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

