&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Team description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp Spain is growing across four office locations, and we&#39;re building our own internal prevention service so that health and safety is looked after by an expert who knows our people and our offices. You&#39;ll be the first specialist in this function, starting from a blank page and setting up the service, the prevention plan and the way safety works at every site. You&#39;ll work with Workplace, People, Legal and managers, with real influence on how safety becomes part of everyday life at SumUp.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note this is a part-time contract of 20 hours per week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎥 Take a look inside our &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q5xfa9S2Fmg&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Barcelona&lt;/a&gt; office&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Set up and run SumUp Spain&#39;s internal prevention service across all offices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review existing risk assessments, close gaps and build the first internal prevention plan&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agree in writing which activities stay with the external prevention provider and which move to the internal service&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliver and track mandatory safety training, and keep documentation audit ready&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Set up contractor coordination (CAE) and report safety KPIs regularly to leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Qualification as a Técnico Superior en Prevención de Riesgos Laborales, with a Master&#39;s in Occupational Risk Prevention and at least two specialisations from Safety at Work, Industrial Hygiene, or Ergonomics and Applied Psychosociology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands on experience running a prevention function independently, including risk assessments, prevention plans and contractor coordination (CAE) documentation under Spanish law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong knowledge of Ley 31/1995 and RD 39/1997, and experience working alongside an external prevention provider.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Track record of building a prevention function from scratch or near scratch, with accurate, audit ready documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fluency in business level Spanish, working knowledge of English and the ability to explain regulations in plain language.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Barcelona office. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp’s future success&lt;/p&gt;
