&lt;h1&gt;Program Manager, KYC Operations&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Sofia, Bulgaria&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Team description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our KYC Operations team helps SumUp verify and onboard businesses safely, so merchants can start taking payments quickly and in line with regulations. As Program Manager, you&#39;ll report directly to the Head of KYC Operations and take real ownership of how initiatives are planned, delivered and adopted across Engineering, Product, Compliance and Operations teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take a look inside our &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/gqtjm5NUXs0?si=t7YARvQWQHHidD_z&quot;&gt;Sofia&lt;/a&gt; office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the delivery of complex KYC and compliance initiatives from first scope to final rollout, including plans and timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the change approach for major transitions, coaching sponsors and team leads and measuring how well new ways of working are adopted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trust with stakeholders across Operations, Compliance, Product and Engineering, balancing competing priorities and resolving disagreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and mantain regular reports, dashboards and provide data insights, so leadership can make faster decisions, and set documentation and process mapping standards that keep teams aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading projects or change programmes that involve several teams, with a track record of delivering complex initiatives from start to finish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with data, building reports from scratch, using evidence and reporting to influence decisions and build consistent processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical thinking, discovering and fixing process and system inefficiencies.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and spoken English, with the ability to simplify complex topics and write clear briefs that help leaders decide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to make sound decisions when things are unclear and to keep work moving when priorities compete.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt; experience in onboarding, KYC, KYB or compliance-related programmes, SQL knowledge or comfort with tools such as Salesforce, Zendesk, ServiceNow and back-office platforms, and formal change management training or certification.&lt;/p&gt;
