&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience managing projects that involve several teams, including Operations, Product, Engineering, Compliance and external partners, with strong planning, dependency tracking and escalation skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Good understanding of fraud prevention, transaction monitoring, chargebacks, payment operations or merchant risk, ideally gained in financial services, payments or fintech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to turn operational needs and risk requirements into clear implementation plans, and to confirm that teams are ready before a launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfort working with tools such as Jira, Notion or Confluence, Salesforce, and Microsoft Office or Google Workspace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
