&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EU GTM | Berlin, Germany&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the team 🙌&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Small businesses are the backbone of the economy, and SumUp is their financial partner. As our Sales Manager in Berlin, you&#39;ll be on the front line: turning warm leads into merchants who actually love what we do. The team moves fast, celebrates wins, and holds each other accountable. No fluff, just results. If you&#39;re hungry to grow and want your work to actually matter — keep reading. 👇&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📞 Pick up warm inbound leads and convert them into active SumUp merchants — consultative, not pushy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⚡ Handle a high volume of enquiries across phone, email, and chat without dropping the ball&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎯 Get to know each prospect&#39;s business and match them with the right SumUp solution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📊 Own your pipeline with clean CRM records&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏆 Hit (and beat) your monthly targets — consistently&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝 Hand off new merchants smoothly to onboarding and customer success so their first experience is great&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💬 Share what you&#39;re hearing in the market to help the team sharpen its game&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
