&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive the end-to-end delivery of backend services within the Cards EU domain, including observability, testing, and production support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead architectural discussions and shape the technical roadmap by proposing solutions for complex, distributed systems challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;bulletList&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;listItem&amp;quot;,null]&quot;&gt;Partner with engineers in adjacent squads and the product manager to shape and refine the squad backlog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;bulletList&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;listItem&amp;quot;,null]&quot;&gt;Mentor engineers through code and design reviews, pragmatic technical trade offs, and knowledge sharing that raises the team&#39;s engineering standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;bulletList&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;listItem&amp;quot;,null]&quot;&gt;Participate in incident reviews and the on-call rotation, taking accountability for the reliability of the services the team builds&lt;/li&gt;
