&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;message&quot;&gt;Our Finance team in Sofia is part of SumUp’s global Finance organisation. We help keep financial information accurate, consistent and delivered on time, enabling stakeholders across the business to make informed decisions.&amp;nbsp;By strengthening financial processes, governance and internal controls, we support SumUp’s responsible growth across markets. Working in an international and collaborative environment, you’ll have the opportunity to contribute to the financial foundations of a global fintech company and help make the way we work more efficient and effective.&lt;/p&gt;
