&lt;p&gt;📍&lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/gqtjm5NUXs0?si=t7YARvQWQHHidD_z&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/gqtjm5NUXs0?si=t7YARvQWQHHidD_z&quot;&gt;Explore our Sofia office&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process and post vendor invoices and credit notes across several legal entities, keeping accuracy and deadlines on track&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and post monthly accruals and support month-end close activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reconcile vendor balances, resolve discrepancies and manage day-to-day vendor communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare weekly payment proposals and complete weekly bank postings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the rollout of a new procurement system (ZIP), including testing and helping stabilise new workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify process inefficiencies and contribute ideas for automation and standardisation within the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
