&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SAP or a similar ERP system used for procure to pay processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with Excel, including pivot tables, VLOOKUP and data tables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent English communication skills, both written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re curious about AI and automation, and use - or are keen to use - AI tools responsibly to streamline repetitive tasks, improve accuracy, and make P2P processes more efficient.&lt;/li&gt;
