&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Marketing Manager - Consumer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is building a consumer financial product with a distribution advantage that almost no other fintech can replicate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than four million merchants use SumUp, and more than a billion consumers come into contact with our products each year. We now have the opportunity to turn that reach into one of the world&#39;s largest consumer financial ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our consumer product is already live across six European markets. The next challenge is to grow it from an emerging proposition into a product used by millions of consumers, and this role will lead that journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the heart of that growth. As &lt;strong&gt;Senior Marketing Manager (Merchant to Consumer)&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll drive the merchant-to-consumer acquisition engine: the channel that converts SumUp&#39;s merchant network and their customers into SumUp personal banking customers.&amp;nbsp; This is a rare chance to build a differentiated acquisition channel from scratch inside a small, ambitious team, competing head-to-head with some of the best-funded neobanks in Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute merchant-to-consumer acquisition campaigns across six markets — owning messaging, creative strategy, localisation, and performance reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed consumer sign-up moments into merchant touchpoints, including the super app, card readers, merchant CRM, and merchant website&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cross-sell from SumUp Local into the consumer banking app, managing conversion, activation, and incentives for consumers coming through merchant-led channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with teams across Hardware, CRM, and other business lines to get consumer acquisition placements shipped through channels you don&#39;t directly own&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reporting on merchant-to-consumer acquisition performance, using it to inform channel-mix decisions and prove cost-per-customer against direct advertising&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong B2C growth or lifecycle marketing experience, ideally in fintech, payments, retail, or a marketplace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of planning and executing campaigns across multiple markets, including localisation and creative direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience marketing through partner or owned channels, such as CRM, in-product surfaces, or point-of-sale,&amp;nbsp; rather than relying solely on paid media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort owning acquisition metrics, attribution, and reporting end to end, with a data-driven and commercially minded approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence and coordinate across matrixed teams to get placements and campaigns shipped without direct authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with a truly global, multicultural team from our central London Bridge location, wrapped in historic charm and modern flair. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave, plus bank holidays and special leaves&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget for attending conferences and/or advancing your career through further education&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏥 Health matters: private health insurance, including optical and dental&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;🚗 Life made easier: salary-sacrifice commuter benefits via Gogeta&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;💼 Financial security: retirement scheme (SumUp matches 7% when you contribute 5%) 🛡 Peace of mind: life insurance from MetLife for 2× your salary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
