&lt;p&gt;At&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;, we believe small merchants are the heartbeat of our communities. By joining the &lt;strong&gt;Lending&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;tribe&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll help launch a new financing product designed for the roughly 50 million registered and informal sole traders in Brazil who currently can&#39;t access affordable credit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll be the technical anchor of a brand new squad, operating with real autonomy. This is a role for someone who&#39;s energised by ambiguity, comfortable owning hard decisions without a playbook to follow, and excited to help shape a lending product from the ground up in a fast-moving, regulated market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the onboarding journey:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and build the onboarding experience for non SumUp customers, including KYC and Open Finance account and income data integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the repayment integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the technical relationship with our Open Finance partner alongside the Bank squad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver the product end to end:&lt;/strong&gt; Build the core lending product experience, from credit assessment through to servicing and collections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Power the credit decisioning:&lt;/strong&gt; Connect Open Finance data to underwriting models to support fast, reliable credit decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the technical direction:&lt;/strong&gt; Make high impact architecture calls with minimal guidance, and coach mid level and entry level engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigate the regulatory landscape: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner closely with the Bank squad, Compliance, and our Open Finance external integration partner on Open Finance requirements in Brazil&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What makes you a great fit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience designing and owning complex distributed systems end to end, ideally backed by around 6 years in software engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong knowledge of Open Finance or Open Banking integrations, gained from working inside a bank, fintech, or another regulated financial product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feel comfortable working in Golang on backend systems, with the flexibility to work confidently in another language such as Java, Kotlin, Python, or Ruby&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can identify gaps and ambiguity early, weigh up tradeoffs, and drive decisions without waiting for perfect information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shares excitement about building a new product from scratch and exploring unfamiliar territory rather than maintaining something established&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌍 Global Experience&lt;/strong&gt;: Collaborate with a diverse team of 3,000+ people from over 90 countries, and join our global off-sites and hackathons.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝 &lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Join a team that values diversity, innovation, and teamwork, where your ideas and contributions truly matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📈 Career Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: Be part of a global team working on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💙 Great Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;: Health plans, meal vouchers (VR), Zenklub, Wellhub, life insurance, childcare allowance, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📚 Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Access an annual budget of &lt;strong&gt;R$ 10,000&lt;/strong&gt; for education, certifications, and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌴 Time Off&lt;/strong&gt;: Enjoy &lt;strong&gt;30 additional days off &lt;/strong&gt;through our &lt;strong&gt;Break4Me&lt;/strong&gt; program after 3 years at SumUp.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💸 Grow with Us: &lt;/strong&gt;Participate in our virtual stock program and benefit from SumUp’s success with company shares.&lt;/p&gt;
