&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building backend services with &lt;strong&gt;Java and Spring Boot&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with distributed systems and microservices architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of event-driven systems, service integration and reliable data flows.&lt;/li&gt;
