&lt;li&gt;Experience writing production-quality, maintainable and well-tested code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ownership mindset and willingness to take responsibility for the systems you build and operate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative approach and the ability to communicate clearly with technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work autonomously while contributing actively to a team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A tool-agnostic mindset and the ability to learn new technologies pragmatically.&lt;/li&gt;
