&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;It would be a plus if you have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building a system or service from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with payments, payouts or other financial technology products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Kubernetes, Docker and AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
