&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-semibold-pgl7 cui-body-normal-pxkh cui-body-highlight-bbub css-10dm8y e173j6r82&quot;&gt;Why you should join SumUp:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
