&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if you have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with Workday HCM Core (experience with additional modules such as Time Tracking or Compensation is a plus)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
