&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail and quality of the deliverables with growth mindset &amp;amp; extreme ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A growth, can-do and customer oriented mindset with extreme ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to work in flexible shift schedules and rotational week-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
