&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tide is looking for a hands-on, technical Engineering Manager to direct the New Markets team, taking ownership of business registration and company formation capabilities across expanding markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Key qualifications and skills required for this role:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in building and operating distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical background (preferrably with the JVM ecosystem)&lt;/li&gt;
