&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-Friendly Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal L&amp;amp;D Budget in the amount of 500€ per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental wellbeing platform Plumm&lt;/li&gt;
