&lt;p&gt;This is a key role in the Financial Control team. We are responsible for the month-end close, the preparation of financial accounts, and play a key role in delivering audits. Reporting to the Finance Manager, you will be an Assistant Management Accountant with experience delivering month-end activities and performing P&amp;amp;L and balance sheet reconciliations.&lt;/p&gt;
