&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the preparation and posting of monthly journals such as accruals, prepayments and adjustments across all entities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own key balance sheet accounts across the group, completing monthly reconciliations and resolving variances in a timely, documented manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with teams across the business, including AP, Tax and Management Reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting the Finance Manager when required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with the annual audits in preparation and provide the requested documents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Analysis:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce P&amp;amp;L variance analysis and commentary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What must you have&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a financial control or management accounting environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Excel or Google Sheets with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Show attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a team player, with ability to work independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What might you have&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform multi-currency balance sheet reconciliations, ideally across multiple entities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with NetSuite and FloQast apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate confidently with internationally based stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
