&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GoCardless, a Mollie company, is a global leader in bank payments. Over 100,000 businesses, from start-ups to household names, use GoCardless to collect, manage and send bank payments through Direct Debit, real-time payments and open banking. With US$130bn+ processed annually across 30+ countries, we handle recurring and one-off payments without the chasing, stress, or expensive fees. Our end-to-end payment platform also features AI-powered solutions to improve payment success and reduce fraud, alongside connections to over 350 platforms businesses use everyday.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are headquartered in the UK, with teams and operations spanning North America, Europe and Asia-Pacific.&amp;nbsp; For more information, please visit&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.gocardless.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; www.gocardless.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; and follow us on LinkedIn&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/gocardless&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; @GoCardless.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Mollie is the leading payments and financial services partner for business, rooted in Europe, with global reach.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Junior Data Analyst to help support our growing business and build out our data capabilities.&amp;nbsp; You will be working with the Analytics team collaborating with teams across business services to build efficiencies which support day to day functions. You will support people across the company by building self-serve analytics content across our analytics tooling - we’re using dbt, Looker, Fivetran, BigQuery and Amplitude at GoCardless. You’ll support the dashboards and underpinning models that enable deep insight into a fast-growing business and develop an expert knowledge of all areas of our operation. You’ll help people in all areas of GoCardless make better, faster, more data-driven decisions. Analytics is part of our Data &amp;amp; Business Systems Group which at its heart exists to maximise day-to-day efficiency and productivity within GoCardless. We do this by bringing together teams that span data &amp;amp; technology to provide a 1 stop shop for our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The main elements of this role will involve:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data collection: Identifying relevant sources, specifying data requirements, and retrieving the data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data cleaning: Inspecting the data, handling missing values and outliers, transforming the data, standardising formats, and validating the cleaned data&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data visualisation: Using visualisations to tell data stories to a variety of audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data analysis: Interpreting results, finding insights, and spotting trends and fluctuations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documentation: Documenting the information and content that will be consumed and processed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting the team: Helping members of the team across various analytics projects, namely building dashboards, supporting pipelines, data cleansing, and providing insights, to name a few.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What excites you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kicking off a data-related career&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a self-starter - you take initiative in spotting opportunities and finding ways to solve problems with data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re used to sharing your technical work with others around you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working on data and pipeline improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working within the data team managing data support tickets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to learn more about data operations, engineering, and analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What excites us&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in data, analytics, dashboard building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail &amp;amp; and an ability to solve complex problems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great team-working skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written &amp;amp; verbal English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can communicate your work clearly to technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of how important clean, accurate, and trusted data is for running a business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A basic understanding of SQL and Data / BI tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred: An understanding of working in an agile environment at pace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don’t expect you to meet every requirement. If you’re excited by this role, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Heads up: we assess technical skills during our process, starting with a few basic SQL syntax questions on the first call, so it’s worth brushing up in advance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base salary range:&lt;/strong&gt; 20,000 EUR - 30,000 EUR&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base salary ranges are based on role, job level, location, and market data.&amp;nbsp; Please note that whilst we strive to offer competitive compensation, our approach is to pay between the &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;minimum and the mid-point&lt;/span&gt; of the pay range until performance can be assessed in role. Offers will take into account level of experience, interview assessment, budgets and parity between you and fellow employees at GoCardless doing similar work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(some of) The good stuff&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing &lt;/strong&gt;- stay healthy with dedicated support and medical cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lunch&lt;/strong&gt;- based on the location, you either get a meal voucher or a paid lunch when working from the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work away scheme&lt;/strong&gt; - gives you the option to work away from your country of residence for up to 20 working days in any 12-month period&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptive Working&lt;/strong&gt; - allows you to work flexibly, around your lifestyle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parental leave&lt;/strong&gt; - to suit everyone embarking on life&#39;s great adventure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt; - lead your own development with an annual learning budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time off&lt;/strong&gt; - generous holiday allowance + volunteer days for ERG events + one day off if you need to move house&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Life at GoCardless&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re an organisation defined by our&lt;a href=&quot;https://gocardless.com/g/values-operating-principles/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; &lt;u&gt;values&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;; We &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;start with why&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;before we begin any project, to ensure it’s aligned with our mission. We &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;make it happen&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, working with urgency and taking personal accountability for getting things done. We&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; act with integrity&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, always. We &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;care deeply&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; about what we do and we know it&#39;s essential that we &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;be humble &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;whilst we do it. Our Values form part of the GoCardless DNA, and are used to not only help us nurture and develop our culture, but to deliver impactful work that will help us to achieve our vision.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;As of April 2025, we had 806 employees (GeeCees) globally, with 524 based in the UK, 163 based in Latvia and 119 across our other offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;To ensure that we&#39;re representative of the world around us - and to be able to review relevant benchmarks - we ask GeeCees to voluntarily disclose diversity data. This year, the proportion of GeeCees providing data increased to 88% (up from 79% in 2024). With regards to diversity within GoCardless, we can see GeeCees identifying as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Asian, Black, Mixed or Other — &lt;strong&gt;25%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Neurodiverse — &lt;strong&gt;9%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;LGBTQIA+ — &lt;strong&gt;9%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Disabled — &lt;strong&gt;1%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Average age — &lt;strong&gt;33&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Female — &lt;strong&gt;45%&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Male —&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt; 55%&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re rooting for you during your application and GoCardless aims to provide reasonable adjustments to make our recruitment process as remarkable and accessible as we can. Please speak to your Talent Partner if you need extra support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to learn more, you can read about our Employee Resource Groups and objectives &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://gocardless.com/about/careers/&amp;amp;sa=D&amp;amp;source=calendar&amp;amp;ust=1781014616204220&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1DeqgyeRfEwEzecwn4oq3j&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sustainability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re committed to reducing our impact on the environment, leaving a more sustainable world for future generations. Check out our sustainability &lt;a href=&quot;https://gocardless.com/sustainability&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;action plan&lt;/u&gt; &lt;/a&gt;here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about Life at GoCardless via &lt;a href=&quot;http://twitter.com/GoCardlessEng&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;http://instagram.com/lifeatgocardless&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;http://linkedin.com/company/gocardless&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GoCardless, a Mollie company, is a global leader in bank payments. Over 100,000 businesses, from start-ups to household names, use GoCardless to collect, manage and send bank payments through Direct Debit, real-time payments and open banking. With US$130bn+ processed annually across 30+ countries, we handle recurring and one-off payments without the chasing, stress, or expensive fees. Our end-to-end payment platform also features AI-powered solutions to improve payment success and reduce fraud, alongside connections to over 350 platforms businesses use everyday.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are headquartered in the UK, with teams and operations spanning North America, Europe and Asia-Pacific.&amp;nbsp; For more information, please visit&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.gocardless.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; www.gocardless.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; and follow us on LinkedIn&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/gocardless&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; @GoCardless.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Mollie is the leading payments and financial services partner for business, rooted in Europe, with global reach.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a key role in the Financial Control team. We are responsible for the month-end close, the preparation of financial accounts, and play a key role in delivering audits. Reporting to the Finance Manager, you will be a Management Accountant with experience delivering month-end activities and performing P&amp;amp;L and balance sheet reconciliations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What excites you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ownership:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own revenue accounting across all GoCardless entities, from recognition through to reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the intercompany (IC) process end to end: manage IC accounts, ensure all IC transactions are recorded and settled, and reconcile IC balances as part of the monthly close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own key balance sheet accounts across the group, completing monthly reconciliations and resolving variances in a timely, documented manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play a key role in the annual audit, acting as a reliable, well-prepared point of contact for auditors across your areas of responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with teams across the business, including Billing and Management Reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to finance projects and process improvement initiatives, including system implementations and controls enhancements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Analysis:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce P&amp;amp;L variance analysis and commentary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What excites us&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate proven experience in a financial control or management accounting environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Excel or Google Sheets with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Show strong attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate confidently with internationally based stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply revenue accounting experience, including knowledge of IFRS 15&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform multi-currency balance sheet reconciliations, ideally across multiple entities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with NetSuite and FloQast apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold an accounting qualification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to identify process efficiencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base salary range:&lt;/strong&gt; €36,000 - €54,000 (including 13th and 14th salary)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base salary ranges are based on role, job level, location, and market data.&amp;nbsp; Please note that whilst we strive to offer competitive compensation, our approach is to pay between the &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;minimum and the mid-point&lt;/span&gt; (€36,000 - €42,000) of the pay range until performance can be assessed in role. Offers will take into account level of experience, interview assessment, budgets and parity between you and fellow employees at GoCardless doing similar work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(some of) The good stuff&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing &lt;/strong&gt;- stay healthy with dedicated support and medical cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lunch&lt;/strong&gt;- based on the location, you either get a meal voucher or a paid lunch when working from the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work away scheme&lt;/strong&gt; - gives you the option to work away from your country of residence for up to 20 working days in any 12-month period&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptive Working&lt;/strong&gt; - allows you to work flexibly, around your lifestyle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parental leave&lt;/strong&gt; - to suit everyone embarking on life&#39;s great adventure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt; - lead your own development with an annual learning budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time off&lt;/strong&gt; - generous holiday allowance + volunteer days for ERG events + one day off if you need to move house&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
