&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re an organisation defined by our&lt;a href=&quot;https://gocardless.com/g/values-operating-principles/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; &lt;u&gt;values&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;; We &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;start with why&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;before we begin any project, to ensure it’s aligned with our mission. We &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;make it happen&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, working with urgency and taking personal accountability for getting things done. We&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; act with integrity&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, always. We &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;care deeply&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; about what we do and we know it&#39;s essential that we &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;be humble &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;whilst we do it. Our Values form part of the GoCardless DNA, and are used to not only help us nurture and develop our culture, but to deliver impactful work that will help us to achieve our vision.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
