&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Male —&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt; 55%&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re rooting for you during your application and GoCardless aims to provide reasonable adjustments to make our recruitment process as remarkable and accessible as we can. Please speak to your Talent Partner if you need extra support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to learn more, you can read about our Employee Resource Groups and objectives &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://gocardless.com/about/careers/&amp;amp;sa=D&amp;amp;source=calendar&amp;amp;ust=1781014616204220&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1DeqgyeRfEwEzecwn4oq3j&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sustainability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re committed to reducing our impact on the environment, leaving a more sustainable world for future generations. Check out our sustainability &lt;a href=&quot;https://gocardless.com/sustainability&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;action plan&lt;/u&gt; &lt;/a&gt;here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about Life at GoCardless via &lt;a href=&quot;http://twitter.com/GoCardlessEng&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;http://instagram.com/lifeatgocardless&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;http://linkedin.com/company/gocardless&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GoCardless, a Mollie company, is a global leader in bank payments. Over 100,000 businesses, from start-ups to household names, use GoCardless to collect, manage and send bank payments through Direct Debit, real-time payments and open banking. With US$130bn+ processed annually across 30+ countries, we handle recurring and one-off payments without the chasing, stress, or expensive fees. Our end-to-end payment platform also features AI-powered solutions to improve payment success and reduce fraud, alongside connections to over 350 platforms businesses use everyday.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are headquartered in the UK, with teams and operations spanning North America, Europe and Asia-Pacific.&amp;nbsp; For more information, please visit&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.gocardless.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; www.gocardless.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; and follow us on LinkedIn&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/gocardless&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; @GoCardless.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Mollie is the leading payments and financial services partner for business, rooted in Europe, with global reach.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GoCardless is the leading open banking payments network. We process payments for tens of thousands of businesses globally, from start-ups to household names, and we are growing fast. In ANZ, we work with some of Australia and New Zealand&#39;s most ambitious companies, and our Sales-led merchant segment is at the heart of that growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Technical Account Manager (TAM) to join our ANZ Customer Success team. This is a new role, created to meet growing demand from Sales-led merchants who need expert technical support alongside their commercial relationship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with our Customer Success Account Managers (CSAMs), serving as their technical counterpart throughout the merchant lifecycle, from integration and go-live to ongoing optimisation and expansion. The CSAMs own the commercial relationship; you own the technical one. Together, you make sure our merchants get the most out of GoCardless.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical relationship management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary technical point of contact for a portfolio of sales-led merchants, building trusted relationships with their engineering, product, and operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand each merchant&#39;s technical environment, how they have integrated GoCardless, what their infrastructure looks like, and where opportunities exist to improve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead regular technical reviews with merchants, reviewing integration health, payment performance, and presenting upcoming product changes that may affect them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implementation and onboarding support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside CSAMs to support new merchant onboarding, ensuring integrations are well-architected from the outset, and merchants are set up for long-term success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide merchants through GoCardless API and webhook integrations, providing hands-on technical consultancy during the build phase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve integration issues early, coordinating with internal Engineering and Product teams where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted technical adviser during merchants’ digital transformations. Billing engine migrations and platform changes create real retention risk — we have lost merchants who wanted to stay with us but made architectural decisions without our input, leaving GoCardless out of their new stack. This TAM should be in the room early for those conversations, helping merchants evaluate how their chosen technologies integrate with GoCardless and ensuring they can get full value from their commitment to the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ongoing technical health&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor integration health across your merchant portfolio to proactively identify risks, such as declining mandate conversion rates, payment failure patterns, or suboptimal API usage, before they become customer problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive technical remediation plans when issues are identified, own the resolution process end-to-end, and keep the CSAM informed throughout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain documentation of merchant technical configurations, integration architectures, and known edge cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with CSAMs to align technical and commercial priorities for each account, contributing to account plans and QBR preparation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the merchant&#39;s voice in internal conversations with Product and Engineering, translating real-world technical pain points into structured feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with the broader EMEA technical community to share learnings, flag emerging integration patterns, and contribute to internal knowledge bases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Support during incidents and P1 technical issues, contributing your account knowledge and technical expertise to accelerate resolution for the highest value merchants. Proactively enable Support with the context they need, integration specifics, known edge cases, and merchant architecture, so that our highest value merchants receive consistently excellent assistance even when the TAM is not directly involved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Merchant enablement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run technical workshops and training sessions for merchants, helping their teams understand GoCardless capabilities and how to get more from the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce clear, practical documentation and guides tailored to individual merchant environments where standard resources do not cover specific use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 to 5 years in a technical role with direct customer-facing responsibility, such as Technical Account Management, Solutions Engineering, Implementation, or Developer Support,&amp;nbsp; at a B2B SaaS or fintech company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid working knowledge of REST APIs, webhooks, and JSON; confident reading and interpreting API documentation and merchant-side code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting merchants or customers through complex technical integrations, ideally in a payments, banking, or financial services context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and troubleshooting skills, able to isolate root causes across integration layers and communicate findings clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills; comfortable presenting to senior stakeholders and running external technical discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised and self-directed, with the ability to manage a portfolio of accounts simultaneously and prioritise competing demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with direct debit, open banking, or recurring payment systems in the ANZ market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with data tools such as SQL, Looker, or equivalent for analysing payment performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior exposure to tools such as Salesforce or JIRA in a customer-facing context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of how large merchants operationalise payment systems, particularly subscription billing, mandate management, and payment reconciliation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the first three months, you will have completed onboarding, built a solid understanding of the GoCardless platform and API, and established working relationships with your CSAM counterparts and the merchant portfolio. You will have a clear view of each account&#39;s technical health.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By six months, you will be operating independently across your portfolio, running technical reviews, owning remediation plans, and contributing meaningfully to account strategy alongside the CSAMs. Merchants will know you as a trusted technical partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At twelve months, you will be a recognised expert on GoCardless integrations in the ANZ market, with measurable impact on integration health, merchant satisfaction, and retention across your accounts. You will be shaping how we scale the TAM function in the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base salary range:&lt;/strong&gt; 84,000 AUD - 126,000 AUD&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base salary ranges are based on role, job level, location, and market data.&amp;nbsp; Please note that whilst we strive to offer competitive compensation, our approach is to pay between the &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;minimum and the mid-point&lt;/span&gt; (84,000 - 105,000 AUD) of the pay range until performance can be assessed in role. Offers will take into account level of experience, interview assessment, budgets and parity between you and fellow employees at GoCardless doing similar work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(some of) The good stuff&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing &lt;/strong&gt;- stay healthy with dedicated support and medical cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lunch&lt;/strong&gt;- based on the location, you either get a meal voucher or a paid lunch when working from the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work away scheme&lt;/strong&gt; - gives you the option to work away from your country of residence for up to 20 working days in any 12-month period&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptive Working&lt;/strong&gt; - allows you to work flexibly, around your lifestyle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parental leave&lt;/strong&gt; - to suit everyone embarking on life&#39;s great adventure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt; - lead your own development with an annual learning budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time off&lt;/strong&gt; - generous holiday allowance + volunteer days for ERG events + one day off if you need to move house&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Life at GoCardless&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re an organisation defined by our&lt;a href=&quot;https://gocardless.com/g/values-operating-principles/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; &lt;u&gt;values&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;; We &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;start with why&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;before we begin any project, to ensure it’s aligned with our mission. We &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;make it happen&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, working with urgency and taking personal accountability for getting things done. We&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; act with integrity&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, always. We &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;care deeply&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; about what we do and we know it&#39;s essential that we &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;be humble &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;whilst we do it. Our Values form part of the GoCardless DNA, and are used to not only help us nurture and develop our culture, but to deliver impactful work that will help us to achieve our vision.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;As of April 2025, we had 806 employees (GeeCees) globally, with 524 based in the UK, 163 based in Latvia and 119 across our other offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;To ensure that we&#39;re representative of the world around us - and to be able to review relevant benchmarks - we ask GeeCees to voluntarily disclose diversity data. This year, the proportion of GeeCees providing data increased to 88% (up from 79% in 2024). With regards to diversity within GoCardless, we can see GeeCees identifying as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Asian, Black, Mixed or Other — &lt;strong&gt;25%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Neurodiverse — &lt;strong&gt;9%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;LGBTQIA+ — &lt;strong&gt;9%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Disabled — &lt;strong&gt;1%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Average age — &lt;strong&gt;33&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Female — &lt;strong&gt;45%&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Male —&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt; 55%&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re rooting for you during your application and GoCardless aims to provide reasonable adjustments to make our recruitment process as remarkable and accessible as we can. Please speak to your Talent Partner if you need extra support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to learn more, you can read about our Employee Resource Groups and objectives &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://gocardless.com/about/careers/&amp;amp;sa=D&amp;amp;source=calendar&amp;amp;ust=1781014616204220&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1DeqgyeRfEwEzecwn4oq3j&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sustainability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re committed to reducing our impact on the environment, leaving a more sustainable world for future generations. Check out our sustainability &lt;a href=&quot;https://gocardless.com/sustainability&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;action plan&lt;/u&gt; &lt;/a&gt;here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about Life at GoCardless via &lt;a href=&quot;http://twitter.com/GoCardlessEng&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;http://instagram.com/lifeatgocardless&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;http://linkedin.com/company/gocardless&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GoCardless, a Mollie company, is a global leader in bank payments. Over 100,000 businesses, from start-ups to household names, use GoCardless to collect, manage and send bank payments through Direct Debit, real-time payments and open banking. With US$130bn+ processed annually across 30+ countries, we handle recurring and one-off payments without the chasing, stress, or expensive fees. Our end-to-end payment platform also features AI-powered solutions to improve payment success and reduce fraud, alongside connections to over 350 platforms businesses use everyday.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are headquartered in the UK, with teams and operations spanning North America, Europe and Asia-Pacific.&amp;nbsp; For more information, please visit&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.gocardless.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; www.gocardless.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; and follow us on LinkedIn&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/gocardless&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; @GoCardless.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Mollie is the leading payments and financial services partner for business, rooted in Europe, with global reach.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a people&#39;s person with technical acumen to assist our customers with a range of issues. You&#39;ll be providing support across GC products and processes.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a technical customer support specialist, you will be the first point of contact for any issues on our API, you will be the main point of escalation within the customer support team. You will be talking to engineers, product owners, customer success, partnership managers, solutions engineers, and many more. These people know what they&#39;re doing, what they need, and really appreciate sharp, to-the-point support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will need to investigate across an array of logs, databases, error monitoring tools. Test and recreate bugs. Consult and improve documentation, collaborate with developers, testers, salespeople and product managers. You will live and breathe customer needs and problems and bring their concerns to the table, be their advocate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As well as overseeing &amp;amp; future-proofing operational processes and workflows, such as using data analysis and stakeholder management to ensure the successful and scalable onboarding of new customers, handling migrations to and away from GoCardless, and the regular review of opportunities with the upgrades of existing customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also be responsible for the team’s visibility within the business, presenting on wins and pushing for product and feature enhancements in line with opportunities spotted. As well as process future-proofing, you’ll be leading the charge to ensure the team is built in an agile and sustainable way, taking the reins when recruitment drives are needed and developing your team mates.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The cases you will handle via our CS platform (Zendesk) will be very diverse and full of surprises. It will not be a numbers game, but one of quality and creativity. From the&amp;nbsp; various cases that you will handle on a daily basis, half are initially a mystery that requires a good amount of head-scratching and collaboration..&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We take pride in the quality of our support and are looking for a professional who will help us take our service to the next level.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What excites you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding complex systems and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Devising new ways to extract and process data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in automating your tasks and making your job easier&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process driven work at varying levels of complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solving and pre-empting risks by drilling in to the details to ‘crack’ a problem and proactively identifying issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering excellent service to our customers and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pushing for improvement opportunities and working alongside your manager to implement these&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working cross functionally to ensure the best experience and outcome for our customers as our processes scale and adapt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support on internal operations and the GoCardless product to colleagues, via internal chats and escalations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and create GoCardless Partner accounts for businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting the company in delivering projects, both internal and external to the Customer Support team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in resolving incidents and sending larger comms to impacted customers, where relevant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What excites us&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in customer support, preferably SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong logical and analytical skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech experience, understanding code. (took a course, dropped out of Computer Science in university, you like to tinker with automations, etc..)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Emotional intelligence and empathy, passion for helping people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resourcefulness, thinking outside of the box and ability to look up information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand the importance of anti-money laundering and counter-terrorist financing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable working with internal stakeholders at all levels, upholding our core product &amp;amp; compliance requirements with a problem-solving approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You don’t lose focus and always look for ways to improve - even if the task is repetitive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a fast learner and not afraid to ask when you don’t know the answer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can prioritise multiple tasks and switch between them effortlessly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a problem solver and have the patience to identify discrepancies and root causes - even if it takes time and you have to dig deep&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You like to dive into details to find the right answer and always follow through to the end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with API&#39;s , Kibana, SQL, Zendesk, Postman, &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary range&lt;/strong&gt; - the expected base salary range for this position is between &lt;strong&gt;€1660 &lt;/strong&gt;-&lt;strong&gt; €2500&lt;/strong&gt; (gross).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base salary ranges may vary and are determined by things like geography, level of experience, interview assessment and parity between you and fellow employees at GoCardless doing similar work. Please note that whilst we strive to offer competitive compensation, there is no guarantee that an offer will reach the upper limit of the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(some of) The good stuff&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing &lt;/strong&gt;- stay healthy with dedicated support and medical cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lunch&lt;/strong&gt;- based on the location, you either get a meal voucher or a paid lunch when working from the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work away scheme&lt;/strong&gt; - gives you the option to work away from your country of residence for up to 20 working days in any 12-month period&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptive Working&lt;/strong&gt; - allows you to work flexibly, around your lifestyle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parental leave&lt;/strong&gt; - to suit everyone embarking on life&#39;s great adventure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt; - lead your own development with an annual learning budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time off&lt;/strong&gt; - generous holiday allowance + volunteer days for ERG events + one day off if you need to move house&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Life at GoCardless&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re an organisation defined by our&lt;a href=&quot;https://gocardless.com/g/values-operating-principles/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; &lt;u&gt;values&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;; We &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;start with why&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;before we begin any project, to ensure it’s aligned with our mission. We &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;make it happen&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, working with urgency and taking personal accountability for getting things done. We&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; act with integrity&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, always. We &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;care deeply&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; about what we do and we know it&#39;s essential that we &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;be humble &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;whilst we do it. Our Values form part of the GoCardless DNA, and are used to not only help us nurture and develop our culture, but to deliver impactful work that will help us to achieve our vision.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;As of April 2025, we had 806 employees (GeeCees) globally, with 524 based in the UK, 163 based in Latvia and 119 across our other offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;To ensure that we&#39;re representative of the world around us - and to be able to review relevant benchmarks - we ask GeeCees to voluntarily disclose diversity data. This year, the proportion of GeeCees providing data increased to 88% (up from 79% in 2024). With regards to diversity within GoCardless, we can see GeeCees identifying as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Asian, Black, Mixed or Other — &lt;strong&gt;25%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Neurodiverse — &lt;strong&gt;9%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;LGBTQIA+ — &lt;strong&gt;9%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Disabled — &lt;strong&gt;1%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Average age — &lt;strong&gt;33&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Female — &lt;strong&gt;45%&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Male —&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt; 55%&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re rooting for you during your application and GoCardless aims to provide reasonable adjustments to make our recruitment process as remarkable and accessible as we can. Please speak to your Talent Partner if you need extra support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to learn more, you can read about our Employee Resource Groups and objectives &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://gocardless.com/about/careers/&amp;amp;sa=D&amp;amp;source=calendar&amp;amp;ust=1781014616204220&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1DeqgyeRfEwEzecwn4oq3j&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sustainability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re committed to reducing our impact on the environment, leaving a more sustainable world for future generations. Check out our sustainability &lt;a href=&quot;https://gocardless.com/sustainability&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;action plan&lt;/u&gt; &lt;/a&gt;here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about Life at GoCardless via &lt;a href=&quot;http://twitter.com/GoCardlessEng&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;http://instagram.com/lifeatgocardless&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;http://linkedin.com/company/gocardless&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GoCardless, a Mollie company, is a global leader in bank payments. Over 100,000 businesses, from start-ups to household names, use GoCardless to collect, manage and send bank payments through Direct Debit, real-time payments and open banking. With US$130bn+ processed annually across 30+ countries, we handle recurring and one-off payments without the chasing, stress, or expensive fees. Our end-to-end payment platform also features AI-powered solutions to improve payment success and reduce fraud, alongside connections to over 350 platforms businesses use everyday.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are headquartered in the UK, with teams and operations spanning North America, Europe and Asia-Pacific.&amp;nbsp; For more information, please visit&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.gocardless.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; www.gocardless.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; and follow us on LinkedIn&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/gocardless&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; @GoCardless.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Mollie is the leading payments and financial services partner for business, rooted in Europe, with global reach.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Treasury Assistant to join the financial reporting team. Working closely with the head of financial reporting and the treasury manager, you will have the opportunity to get involved in the treasury management of GoCardless.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What excites you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparing weekly and daily cash flows and performing liquidity controls to ensure sufficient liquidity within the groups entities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with other teams including AP and management reporting ensuring accurate treasury balance forecasting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership of monitoring the groups bank accounts and reconciling accounts to balances.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide cover for bank reconciliations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting the treasury manager and head of financial reporting as required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support ad hoc projects as and when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What excites us&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-3 years of treasury experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intermediate excel / google sheet skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to use AI and to automate tasks and processes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in treasury forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritise time and stay organised in a fast-paced environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with multi-currency treasury operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to produce accurate work and consistently deliver to reporting deadlines&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player but ability to work independently&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don’t expect you to meet every requirement. If you’re excited by this role, we encourage you to apply.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base salary range:&lt;/strong&gt; £32,000 - £48,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base salary ranges are based on role, job level, location, and market data.&amp;nbsp; Please note that whilst we strive to offer competitive compensation, our approach is to pay between the minimum and the mid-point (£32,000 - £40,000) of the pay range until performance can be assessed in role. Offers will take into account level of experience, interview assessment, budgets and parity between you and fellow employees at GoCardless doing similar work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(some of) The good stuff&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing &lt;/strong&gt;- stay healthy with dedicated support and medical cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lunch&lt;/strong&gt;- based on the location, you either get a meal voucher or a paid lunch when working from the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work away scheme&lt;/strong&gt; - gives you the option to work away from your country of residence for up to 20 working days in any 12-month period&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptive Working&lt;/strong&gt; - allows you to work flexibly, around your lifestyle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parental leave&lt;/strong&gt; - to suit everyone embarking on life&#39;s great adventure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt; - lead your own development with an annual learning budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time off&lt;/strong&gt; - generous holiday allowance + volunteer days for ERG events + one day off if you need to move house&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Life at GoCardless&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re an organisation defined by our&lt;a href=&quot;https://gocardless.com/g/values-operating-principles/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; &lt;u&gt;values&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;; We &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;start with why&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;before we begin any project, to ensure it’s aligned with our mission. We &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;make it happen&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, working with urgency and taking personal accountability for getting things done. We&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; act with integrity&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, always. We &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;care deeply&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; about what we do and we know it&#39;s essential that we &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;be humble &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;whilst we do it. Our Values form part of the GoCardless DNA, and are used to not only help us nurture and develop our culture, but to deliver impactful work that will help us to achieve our vision.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
