&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what you’ll be doing as Creative Design Lead:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn customer insights and propositions into campaign ideas across static, motion, short-form video, UGC-style and social.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create concepts, hooks and variants for Meta, Google, TikTok and YouTube, tailored by audience, market and funnel stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape test hypotheses with Acquisition and Growth Optimisation, and use CTR, CVR, CPA and ROAS to decide what to make next.&lt;/li&gt;
