&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain the web side of the design system (components, templates, responsive patterns) so pages ship quickly and consistently across markets and languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and document AI-assisted production workflows (concepting, image and video generation, variations, localisation) that the whole team uses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own creative governance: brand consistency across markets, languages, channels and the website, including templates, message kits and quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the creative bar in the pod through critique, standards and hands-on leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll report to our Director of Brand &amp;amp; Creative.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what we’d love from our new Creative Design Lead:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years as a marketing or performance designer, ideally in B2C, fintech, e-commerce or another fast-growing digital business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven web and UX/UI design experience: responsive landing pages and site templates built to convert, working closely with developers through to launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily, hands-on use of AI in their creative process, with concrete examples of what it changed (speed, volume, quality)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real performance marketing experience, with the ability to talk fluently about how creative drives CTR, CVR and CPA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong craft across static, motion and video, with solid design fundamentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively brings their own ideas rather than waiting for the perfect brief&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio with real campaigns, web work and AI-powered work, ideally with results&lt;/li&gt;
