&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adobe CC &lt;/strong&gt;(Photoshop, Illustrator, After Effects and/or Premiere)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;generative AI tools for image and video (e.g. Midjourney, Firefly, Runway, Higgsfield, Kling, Veo) and LLMs (Claude or ChatGPT)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We would like to also ask you to attach your portfolio with an application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And if you can also do this stuff, even better:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
