&lt;li&gt;UGC and creator content direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has built design systems or templates at scale, including web components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accessibility (WCAG) and SEO-aware page design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentoring or leading designers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A second language, or lived experience across borders&lt;/li&gt;
