&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly analytical and motivated intern to join our Treasury team. This internship will combine expertise in foreign exchange (FX) trading with a strong focus on data analysis, including market data, customer transaction behavior, and the development of automated trading strategies and dashboards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Learn &amp;amp; Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a practical, learning-focused internship where you will directly support our Quantitative Analysts by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Assisting in the collection and analysis of market data and customer transaction patterns using SQL and Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Helping to develop and test models that inform real-time trading decisions and risk management strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Learning and practicing your coding skills to automate data preparation for internal reports and dashboards (e.g., in Tableau or Power BI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FX Risk:&lt;/strong&gt; Supporting the team with daily reporting and data verification related to foreign exchange (FX) exposure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interest Rate Risk: &lt;/strong&gt;Supporting the team with short-term investments of excess operational cash and client funds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Gaining exposure to complex treasury and trading workflows not found in traditional finance environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being a 3rd-4th year student of Economics / Finance / Accounting / Mathematics or related area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible availability during work hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B2 and a higher level of both spoken and written English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of SQL - ability to make basic queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good analytical skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage time effectively to meet testing deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being self-motivated and willing to learn new stuff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in Financial Markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;we believe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At TransferGo, we offer competitive rewards to all people. We know that recognition is about more than just money, and we’ve fostered a culture of kudos to shine a light on the great work throughout the business, and the people making it all happen. We hold regular in-person events to connect with each other and help all our TransferNauts to grow with a generous training allowance. We believe that empowering people makes for a happier and more effective workforce. This means we enable anyone who wants to pursue initiatives that deliver real value for our migrant customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;What’s in It for You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real-world FX and Treasury trading desk experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship and guidance from the Treasury team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Palangos street 4, Vilnius, Lithuania (Hybrid). Hybrid work format.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; 3 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We would like to inform that this is unpaid internship.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;At TransferGo, we are committed to the equal treatment of all current and prospective employees. We will not tolerate discrimination on the basis of age, disability, sex, sexual orientation, pregnancy and maternity, race or ethnicity, religion or belief, gender identity,&amp;nbsp; marriage, civil partnership or any other protected category. We are proud of our diverse and inclusive culture and we strongly encourage suitably qualified applicants from a wide range of backgrounds to apply and join TransferGo. We look forward to meeting you! &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Please note that all data collected will be handled in accordance with our candidates privacy policy (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.transfergo.com/privacy-policy/overview&quot;&gt;https://www.transfergo.com/privacy-policy/overview&lt;/a&gt;) &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;and will only be used for the purpose of evaluating your candidacy. The data will be securely stored and deleted according to retention timeframe set in the candidates privacy policy. If you have any questions or concerns regarding this, please feel free to reach out by replying or via dpo@transfergo.&lt;/em&gt;com&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TransferGo&lt;/strong&gt; is a growing fintech scale-up on a mission to champion financial freedom with care. We strive to provide tailored, more affordable financial services that make people&#39;s hard-earned money go further. Now in our 14th year, with close to 400 employees in offices across Europe and the UK, we’re crafting a brilliant, relevant product that makes a difference in people&#39;s lives and the well-being of their families.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve come this far by building a talented, diverse workforce on a fair culture and our strong values. Having this strong team of employees, we can serve those who really need our product to make their lives better.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Head of Regulatory Compliance to lead TransferGo&#39;s Group-wide Regulatory Compliance function. You&#39;ll be the appointed Compliance Officer and Outsourcing Officer of TransferGo Lithuania UAB, the main point of contact with the Bank of Lithuania. You’ll lead the regulatory compliance teams for both TransferGo Lithuania UAB and TransferGo Limited in the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll functionally report to the Management Board and Supervisory Board, and administratively report to the Group Chief Compliance Officer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading the Group-wide Regulatory Compliance function, including the regulatory compliance teams for both TransferGo Lithuania UAB and TransferGo Limited in the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as Compliance Officer and Outsourcing Officer of TransferGo Lithuania UAB, including governance of outsourcing arrangements and the outsourcing register&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring compliance with applicable laws, regulations, the Articles of Association and internal policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as the main point of contact with the Bank of Lithuania and other regulators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning global regulatory reporting and ensuring returns are accurate and on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading licensing and authorisation, regulatory inspections and remediation projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Running the compliance programme, annual risk assessment, compliance plan and monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying breaches and incidents and notifying regulators within deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carrying out fit and proper assessments and managing governance-related regulatory submissions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring regulatory change and assessing its impact on the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting to the Management Board and Supervisory Board at least quarterly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advising and training business units, including compliance assessments&amp;nbsp; on new products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here&#39;s what we&#39;d love from you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A university degree, ideally in Law, Economics, Banking, Business Administration, Finance or a similar field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years in a similar position, including leading a compliance team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong governance experience working with senior management and boards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive knowledge of Lithuanian, EU and UK financial services regulation, including Payment Services and Electronic Money, Conduct of Business, Fit and Proper, Safeguarding, Outsourcing and third-party risk, Regulatory Reporting, Customer Complaints, and Internal Controls and Governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regulatory licensing and authorisation experience, including handling regulator inquiries, examinations and inspections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning regulatory reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience governing outsourcing and third-party arrangements: pre-contractual assessments, outsourcing registers, ongoing monitoring and regulator notifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and spoken Lithuanian and English, with the ability to explain complex compliance topics clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An impeccable reputation, no criminal convictions and nothing that would prevent you from holding the Compliance Officer and Outsourcing Officer key function positions at a financial institution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And if you can also do this stuff, even better&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience at a high-growth fintech or a regulated payments or e-money firm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with the FCA and UK regulatory regimes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with regulatory obligations across multiple EU jurisdictions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of adjacent areas such as AML/CTF, GDPR and DORA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and analytical skills, with attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, collaborative mindset that balances compliance needs with commercial goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we believe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At TransferGo&lt;/strong&gt;, we offer competitive rewards to all people. We know that recognition is about more than just money, and we’ve fostered a culture of kudos to shine a light on the great work throughout the business, and the people making it all happen. We hold regular in person events to connect with each other and help all our TransferNauts to grow with a generous training allowance. We believe that empowering people makes for a happier and more effective workforce. This means we enable anyone who wants to pursue initiatives that deliver real value for our migrant customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/strong&gt;: Starting from €6110 - €7330 (gross) per month, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;: Including a generous holiday allowance, competitive healthcare insurance, and a wellbeing package from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Annual Development Budget&lt;/strong&gt;: €1,000 to invest in your personal and professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Working Environment&lt;/strong&gt;: Flexibility to work from home and in the office, with most team members in the office two days a week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pet-Friendly Office&lt;/strong&gt;: If you’re near one of our offices, bring your furry friend along!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusive Culture&lt;/strong&gt;: Regular in-person events, fostering a strong sense of community and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empowerment and Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: We believe in empowering our people to take initiative and drive meaningful change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;At TransferGo, we are committed to the equal treatment of all current and prospective employees. We will not tolerate discrimination on the basis of age, disability, sex, sexual orientation, pregnancy and maternity, race or ethnicity, religion or belief, gender identity,&amp;nbsp; marriage, civil partnership or any other protected category. We are proud of our diverse and inclusive culture and we strongly encourage suitably qualified applicants from a wide range of backgrounds to apply and join TransferGo. We look forward to meeting you! &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Please note that all data collected will be handled in accordance with our candidates privacy policy (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.transfergo.com/privacy-policy/overview&quot;&gt;https://www.transfergo.com/privacy-policy/overview&lt;/a&gt;) &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;and will only be used for the purpose of evaluating your candidacy. The data will be securely stored and deleted according to retention timeframe set in the candidates privacy policy. If you have any questions or concerns regarding this, please feel free to reach out by replying or via dpo@transfergo.&lt;/em&gt;com&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TransferGo&lt;/strong&gt; is a growing fintech scale-up on a mission to champion financial freedom with care. We strive to provide tailored, more affordable financial services that make people&#39;s hard-earned money go further. Now in our 14th year, with close to 400 employees in offices across Europe and the UK, we’re crafting a brilliant, relevant product that makes a difference in people&#39;s lives and the well-being of their families.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve come this far by building a talented, diverse workforce on a fair culture and our strong values. Having this strong team of employees, we can serve those who really need our product to make their lives better.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;sec&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own onboarding from the first screen to a verified account. It already works, and the PM who runs it today will hand it over with the history behind it. Now we need more people to get through, one step and one country at a time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some people are stopped by our risk checks, and that&#39;s fine. Others leave because a step is confusing or slow, and those are the ones you&#39;ll go after.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;owns&quot;&gt;Compliance decides what we check. Our compliance product team runs the verification process and the vendors behind it. You decide how it works for the customer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;sec&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;sec shared&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hire builders. Our PMs prototype with AI before engineering builds anything, operations people automate their own work, and if you can fix something today, you don&#39;t open a ticket for it.&amp;nbsp;We all use AI in our daily work, so in the interview we&#39;ll ask you to show us something you built with it. We care more about how fast you&#39;re learning and what you&#39;ve made than about where you&#39;re starting from.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;sec&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like after six months&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;More of the people who start onboarding finish it, and our risk checks are as strict as they were.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;KYC and verification pass rates are up in the countries where we lose the most people, and you can explain why each fix worked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing trusts the numbers from first ad to verified account.
&lt;section class=&quot;sec&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the onboarding roadmap and its numbers: completion, KYC pass rates and time to verify, by step and by country. Decide what to fix first, and say plainly what we&#39;re leaving alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;When customers get stuck, work out why from the data and what they tell Support, then test a fix and see if it helps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring the compliance teams evidence of where customers struggle, and ideas for checking the same things with fewer people dropping out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with your engineers and designers most days. Answer their questions before they hold up the work, and push back when the logic gets more complicated than it needs to be.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the teams before and after onboarding so the hand-offs don&#39;t show, and make sure the events Marketing relies on are right.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to go faster, for example to turn a long regulation into a first-draft spec or to sort thousands of failure reasons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’d love from you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years as a product manager, ideally on onboarding, growth or another funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve turned a vague goal like “more people get verified” into a plan, and you like talking to customers and use what you hear to decide what to build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You write your own SQL, and you&#39;ve run enough A/B tests to know when a result isn&#39;t significant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve shipped in a regulated product, kept Compliance on side and still held one clear roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use AI every day and have built at least one thing with it that you still use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You write clearly in English, and you can say no to good ideas to protect the important ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Even better if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identity verification experience, such as document checks, liveness or database checks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing tech such as AppsFlyer, Adjust or Branch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fintech in more than one country.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
