&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/strong&gt;: Starting from 2250€ - 3370 € (gross) per month, depending on experience. Salary is just one part of the conversation – if you’re excited about the role but the range feels slightly off, don’t hesitate to apply. We’re open to discussing based on your experience and potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;: Including a generous holiday allowance, competitive healthcare insurance, and a wellbeing package from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
