&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TransferGo&lt;/strong&gt; is a growing fintech scale-up on a mission to champion financial freedom with care. We strive to provide tailored, more affordable financial services that make people&#39;s hard-earned money go further. Now in our 14th year, with close to 400 employees in offices across Europe and the UK, we’re crafting a brilliant, relevant product that makes a difference in people&#39;s lives and the well-being of their families.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
