&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Careem Quik, you will join a fast-moving team where quality carries real authority, and where the people on the ground have the final say on what reaches the customer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;As Quality Specialist, you will set the quality and food safety standards for our fresh and ultra-fresh range, with a strong focus on Fruits &amp;amp; Vegetables, and lead the team that holds those standards across our dark stores and distribution centres.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot;&gt;Own quality, food safety, and cold chain standards across our fresh and ultra-fresh range, with a strong focus on Fruits &amp;amp; Vegetables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot;&gt;Lead, train, and develop a team of quality controllers and supervisors across dark stores and distribution centres.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot;&gt;Audit product freshness, storage, and handling regularly, and follow through on findings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot;&gt;Review refunds and customer complaints, lead root cause analyses, and put corrective and preventive actions in place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot;&gt;Evaluate supplier performance and work with Commercial and Supply Chain teams to hold suppliers to Careem’s standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,5,0&quot;&gt;Report quality metrics and recommend improvements, including new tools and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,6,0&quot;&gt;Maintain product specifications, checklists, and SOPs, and keep operations compliant with local food safety regulations and hygiene protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;Minimum 3 to 5 years of experience in food quality or food safety, ideally in fresh produce, fresh grocery, retail, quick commerce, or food distribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;Experience managing quality control in warehouse, dark store, or fulfillment environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of the cold chain, HACCP, and UAE food safety standards. Advanced food safety certification is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with experience using data for root cause analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;Ability to lead and train frontline teams, with strong communication and collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
