&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We’re now entering our next chapter — one powered by AI. We’re looking for AI talent: curious problem-solvers who know how to apply AI to build tools, automate workflows, and create real impact. Whether it’s streamlining operations, enhancing customer experience, or reimagining internal systems — we want people who can make Careem work smarter and move faster.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Careem is looking for a senior individual contributor who is a true functional expert in Oracle ERP. You will&amp;nbsp;be the go-to specialist across Finance and Supply Chain, hands-on in the system every day: designing&amp;nbsp;and configuring solutions, solving complex production issues, and turning business needs into stable,&amp;nbsp;scalable ERP processes. You will work from Pakistan with stakeholders in the UAE and other Careem&amp;nbsp;markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finance
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the subject-matter expert for General Ledger, Accounts Receivable, Accounts Payable and Fixed&amp;nbsp;Assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure and optimize period-close, reconciliation, intercompany and reporting processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate finance requirements into clear functional designs and hands-on configuration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supply Chain &amp;amp; Procurement
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the subject-matter expert for Procurement, Purchasing and Supply Chain processes and their&amp;nbsp;financial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Streamline procure-to-pay flows, approvals, supplier setup and controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and deliver automation opportunities across the end-to-end process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery, Support &amp;amp; Stability
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personally investigate and resolve production incidents, and drive root cause analysis so issues do not&amp;nbsp;recur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support major incident bridges as the functional authority for your modules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own quarterly release testing, regression and change readiness for your areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead data migration, reconciliation and reporting work (OTBI, BI Publisher).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Integration team on ERP connections to payments and data platforms (OIC,REST/SOAP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with vendors and system integrators to review designs and quality of delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document designs, configurations and runbooks, and coach colleagues on best practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Key Skills:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oracle Fusion Financials: General Ledger, Accounts Receivable, Accounts Payable, Fixed Assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oracle Procurement and Supply Chain: procure-to-pay, purchasing, supplier management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oracle Integration Cloud (OIC), REST/SOAP APIs and middleware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data migration, reconciliation and reporting (OTBI, BI Publisher)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Functional design, configuration, testing and user acceptance support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incident, problem and change management (ITIL-style), root cause analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process automation and low-code workflow tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly release testing and regression management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and verbal communication with business and technical team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 15 years of hands-on ERP implementation and support experience, with deep functional&amp;nbsp;expertise in Finance and Supply Chain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with Oracle ERP (Fusion Cloud), or an equivalent such as SAP or Workday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven record as a senior individual contributor on large multi-module programs, including integrations&amp;nbsp;and data migration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grounding in ITIL-style incident, problem and change management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to turn complex business needs into clear functional designs, and to explain them to technical&amp;nbsp;and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership, sound judgment and a calm approach to production issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Finance or a related field. An MBA or Master&#39;s&amp;nbsp;degree is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
