&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Careem is building the Everything App for the greater Middle East — making it easy to move around, order food and groceries, manage payments, and more. Our purpose is simple: to simplify and improve people’s lives and build an awesome organisation that inspires.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Since 2012, Careem has enabled earnings for over 2.5 million Captains, simplified the lives of more than 70 million customers, and built a platform where the region’s best talent and entrepreneurs thrive. We operate in 70+ cities across 10 countries, from Morocco to Pakistan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We’re now entering our next chapter — one powered by AI. We’re looking for AI talent: curious problem-solvers who know how to apply AI to build tools, automate workflows, and create real impact. Whether it’s streamlining operations, enhancing customer experience, or reimagining internal systems — we want people who can make Careem work smarter and move faster.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Operations Associate - Shops to own the performance of our Shops marketplace across the UAE and Jordan. This is a purely marketplace mandate so your world is Shops partners, their in-store picking teams, and the KPIs that determine a delightful customer experience. You&#39;ll sit at the intersection of Shops partners operations, strategic planning, and hands-on picking excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shops Partners Operations Performance. &lt;/strong&gt;Own the end-to-end performance scorecard for Shops partners across UAE &amp;amp; JOR - order acceptance rate, prep time, order accuracy, cancellation rate, and customer contact rate and run the cadence that holds Shops accountable to it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Planning &amp;amp; KPI Improvement. &lt;/strong&gt;Translate performance gaps into a strategic roadmap: identify the top drivers of GMV leakage, AOV underperformance, and take-rate erosion, and build the initiatives that close them, from pilot to regional rollout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picking Operations Management. &lt;/strong&gt;Manage the picking operation embedded within partner stores across UAE and Jordan - picker productivity, pick-to-pack time, and accuracy, including training standards, tooling, and process design that partners can actually run day-to-day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unit Economics. &lt;/strong&gt;Build and defend the Last-Mile Unit Economics of every Shops partners cohort, working with Captain Operations to balance delivery cost, speed, and Captain earnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Reviews. &lt;/strong&gt;Run quarterly and monthly business reviews with top Shops accounts, using cohort-level data (e.g., &quot;Based on recent cohorts in Abu Dhabi and Amman...&quot;) to justify investment or intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Peak Planning. &lt;/strong&gt;Lead peak-season readiness planning for Ramadan and Dubai Shopping Festival - demand forecasting, Shops capacity planning, and picking-team surge staffing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-3 years in operations, quick-commerce, last-mile logistics, or retail/e-commerce marketplace roles, with at least 2 years managing teams and external partners directly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing frontline or in-store operations (picking, warehousing, fulfillment) - you&#39;ve been on the floor, not just in the dashboard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data fluency (Excel/SQL and BI tools) paired with the judgment to know when a number needs a conversation, not just a chart.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel regularly between the UAE and Jordan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be fluent in English; Arabic fluency is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’ll provide you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer colleagues the opportunity to drive impact in the region while they learn and grow. As a full time Careem colleague, you will be able to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work and learn from great minds by joining a community of inspiring colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Put your passion to work in a purposeful organisation dedicated to creating impact in a region with a lot of untapped potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore new opportunities to learn and grow every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work 4 days a week in office &amp;amp; 1 day from home, and remotely from any country in the world for 30 days a year with unlimited vacation days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to healthcare benefits and fitness reimbursements for health activities including gym, health club, and training classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Careem is building the Everything App for the greater Middle East — making it easy to move around, order food and groceries, manage payments, and more. Our purpose is simple: to simplify and improve people’s lives and build an awesome organisation that inspires.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Since 2012, Careem has enabled earnings for over 2.5 million Captains, simplified the lives of more than 70 million customers, and built a platform where the region’s best talent and entrepreneurs thrive. We operate in 70+ cities across 10 countries, from Morocco to Pakistan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We’re now entering our next chapter — one powered by AI. We’re looking for AI talent: curious problem-solvers who know how to apply AI to build tools, automate workflows, and create real impact. Whether it’s streamlining operations, enhancing customer experience, or reimagining internal systems — we want people who can make Careem work smarter and move faster.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of Operations, Care, Product, and Finance — turning business priorities into structured programs, and using data and policy design to make customer experience consistent, efficient, and scalable across every market and business line we operate in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll act as an individual contributor with real strategic influence: owning recurring performance reviews with vertical and market leads, running the analysis that shapes product and commercial roadmaps, and leading the policy decisions that define how the business treats its customers when things go right — and when they don&#39;t.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Performance Governance &amp;amp; Business Reviews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the cadence of recurring performance reviews across multiple business lines — monthly and weekly reviews, goal check-ins, and steering updates — ensuring decks are current, owners are clear, and action items get tracked to closure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with vertical, commercial, and finance leads to keep review formats, targets, and metrics consistent as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build a single, credible view of operational and customer experience performance that leadership can act on.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. End-2-End Customer Experience Governance including ownership of L0 metrics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aligns Product, Operations, Care around shared journey-level priorities and drive consistent policy and quality of service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads experience reviews, journey mapping workshops, and gap-closure plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensures policy, process, product, and communication remain consistent even as platforms evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creates a unified view of customer experience performance across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own CSAT and Contact Rate Careem-level&amp;nbsp; L0 metrics for Care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Cohort-Led Customer Policy Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and rollout of customer-facing policies — refunds, compensation, service-recovery thresholds — balancing customer experience against cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop segment-led (cohort-based) policies that treat customers differently based on value and history, while keeping the system simple enough to operate at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the governance forums that keep policy application consistent across markets, and partner with legacy or market-specific teams to bring outlying markets onto a common framework over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Contact Rate &amp;amp; Product led Defect Reduction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and publish a regular, company-wide contact rate report — tracking performance against target by business line, surfacing the top drivers of customer contact, and translating them into a clear set of ask’s for product and commercial teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the dashboards and source data that back this reporting, and keep the distribution list and format current as stakeholders change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with data and analytics partners to keep root-cause analysis sharp enough to drive real roadmap decisions, not just track a number.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Cross-Functional Program Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the connective tissue between Operations, Care, Product, Finance, and Data teams — translating strategy into structured, trackable programs with clear ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Operations and Care in cross-functional forums and leadership reviews, and keep a live view of open decisions, dependencies, and risks across workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Interfaces &amp;amp; Forums&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Teams: &lt;/strong&gt;Care Ops, Product &amp;amp; Engineering, Workforce Management, Vendor Ops, Policy, Data &amp;amp; Analytics, Operations Excellence, Finance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Forums:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational governance and Customer experience reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defect-reduction and Lumina forums&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automation and AI roadmap reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Program steering committees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly and monthly business reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in operations strategy, program management, business operations, or a related analytical/cross-functional role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of owning recurring reporting or business-review cadences with senior stakeholders, end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills — comfortable working with dashboards and raw data to build a narrative, not just a chart.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or governing customer-facing policy, ideally in a marketplace, e-commerce, delivery, or platform business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management — able to align Product, Finance, Commercial, and Operations partners who don&#39;t always start from the same page.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity: this role is as much about building the structure as running it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with workforce management, vendor operations, or AI-enabled quality/automation tooling is a plus, though not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A predictable, trusted cadence of performance reviews that leadership relies on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer policies that are consistent, cohort-aware, and easy to apply across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A measurable, sustained reduction in customer contact driven by root-cause fixes, not just workarounds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stronger cross-functional execution — fewer dropped handoffs between Operations, Care, Product, and Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’ll provide you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer colleagues the opportunity to drive impact in the region while they learn and grow. As a full time Careem colleague, you will be able to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work and learn from great minds by joining a community of inspiring colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Put your passion to work in a purposeful organisation dedicated to creating impact in a region with a lot of untapped potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore new opportunities to learn and grow every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work 4 days a week in office &amp;amp; 1 day from home, and remotely from any country in the world for 30 days a year with unlimited vacation days per year. (If you are in an individual contributor role in tech, you will have 2 office days a week and 3 to work from home.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to healthcare benefits and fitness reimbursements for health activities including gym, health club, and training classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Careem is building the Everything App for the greater Middle East — making it easy to move around, order food and groceries, manage payments, and more. Our purpose is simple: to simplify and improve people’s lives and build an awesome organisation that inspires.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Since 2012, Careem has enabled earnings for over 2.5 million Captains, simplified the lives of more than 70 million customers, and built a platform where the region’s best talent and entrepreneurs thrive. We operate in 70+ cities across 10 countries, from Morocco to Pakistan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We’re now entering our next chapter — one powered by AI. We’re looking for AI talent: curious problem-solvers who know how to apply AI to build tools, automate workflows, and create real impact. Whether it’s streamlining operations, enhancing customer experience, or reimagining internal systems — we want people who can make Careem work smarter and move faster.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Careem, the mission for the NextGen program is to help grow our new joint Engineering by learning how to write Clean Code, use SOLID principle techniques, and design reliable systems. The ultimate goal is to train the new Engineers to build Engineering excellence foundations with high standards. Our program covers all the areas of Careem tech be it Cyber Security, Data, Infrastructure, and all the Software Engineering tracks like Backend, Frontend as well as Mobile.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We are looking for software engineers to join our team of talented engineers that share a common interest in distributed backend systems, their scalability, and continued development. You will work alongside a top talent for an accelerated learning path. You will have access to some of the most exciting projects and advanced tech for accelerated learning and exposure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will be responsible for maintaining some of our services that power the Careem Engine, scaling highly distributed systems, and continuously documenting and improving our engineering practices. These large-scale, distributed systems handle everything from user requests to payment processing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our tech stack is Java 8 and Spring Boot, Micro-Service Architecture, SQL and no-SQL DBs, and AWS infrastructure. Key responsibilities include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Development of our distributed backend system to meet the challenging functional, scalability, and reliability requirements for our fast-growing business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Maintain features and systems, with an emphasis on code quality, maintainability, readability, and testing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Facilitate collaboration with other engineers, product owners, and designers to solve interesting and challenging problems across our platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Be a valued member of an autonomous, cross-functional agile team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; You care about quality and you know what it means to ship high-quality code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Fresh graduates are encouraged to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate will have a passionate commitment to improving the lives of people, an insane focus on excellence and customer service, and a strong alignment with our core values: being bold, focused, agile and collaborative.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree in Computer Science or other related technical fields.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Understanding of Object-oriented design, data structures, and algorithms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ability to solve complex problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Must be able to write clean and maintainable code (must love coding!).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ability to effectively articulate technical challenges and solutions; deal with loosely defined problems and fast-changing requirements &amp;amp; think abstractly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Passionate about learning new technologies and working on a product of massive scale and impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Able to communicate effectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Attention to detail.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of AWS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of clean code principles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of design patterns&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability of test-driven development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
