&lt;li&gt;Ability to solve complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to write clean and maintainable code (must love coding!).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to effectively articulate technical challenges and solutions; deal with loosely defined problems and fast-changing requirements &amp;amp; think abstractly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about learning new technologies and working on a product of massive scale and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to communicate effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
