&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships with clients, guiding them through the sales process and helping ensure a successful implementation of Stripe Tax.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the product, engineering, marketing, and customer success teams to ensure client satisfaction and long-term growth.&lt;/li&gt;
