&lt;p&gt;You are an adept salesperson, able to hold business-level and technical conversations at every level of a large organization, up to the C-suite (CEO, CFO, CIO and CTO). You are used to building value in competitive, long-cycle enterprise situations and enjoy working on products that require deep product understanding combined with technical knowledge. You are as comfortable working with clients as with internal stakeholders, including executives. You are excited to become an expert and share your knowledge. You are an organized self-starter and an excellent communicator who is highly analytical and has a track record of improving the processes and organizations around you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
