&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor and Terminal expert, both internally and externally, to drive customer success and influence product direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product, Marketing and User Operations teams to refine our approach and fuel Terminal&#39;s growth in retail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
