&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the India Startups team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;India is producing a new generation of SaaS companies, digital-native businesses, platforms, marketplaces, and AI-first startups with global ambitions. These businesses need more than a payments provider. They need financial infrastructure that can support rapid growth, international expansion, new products, and increasingly complex business models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Startups Grower team helps Stripe’s largest and fastest-growing startup users realize more value from Stripe. We combine commercial ownership with deep curiosity about our users’ businesses. We work with founders, CFOs, product leaders, and engineering teams to understand where they are going next, then bring together the right people and products across Stripe to help them get there.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to shape how Stripe serves India’s most ambitious technology companies. You will join a focused, entrepreneurial team in Bengaluru while working closely with colleagues across Stripe’s global Product, Solutions Architecture, Customer Success, Risk, Legal, Finance, and Operations organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own and grow a portfolio of high-potential startup customers. Your goal will be to build trusted, long-term relationships, retain and expand existing revenue, and help users adopt the Stripe products that best support their next phase of growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of each user’s business model, growth plans, technical architecture, and financial infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with founders and senior stakeholders across finance, product, engineering, and operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create account plans that identify retention risks, expansion opportunities, decision-makers, and clear paths to measurable user value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead renewals and commercial negotiations with a focus on durable partnerships, strong outcomes for users, and responsible revenue growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and close opportunities for additional product adoption, new use cases, deeper integrations, and international expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run thoughtful discovery and product conversations that connect Stripe’s capabilities to outcomes such as revenue growth, improved conversion, fraud reduction, faster launches, and greater operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a portfolio with rigor, using data to prioritize accounts, forecast accurately, and focus time on the opportunities with the greatest potential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute scaled campaigns for groups of users with similar needs while maintaining a high-quality, consultative experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate across Solutions Architecture, Customer Success, Product, Risk, Legal, Finance, and Operations to resolve complex issues and set users up for long-term success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring structured feedback from Indian startups to Stripe’s Product and leadership teams, helping improve our products, positioning, and market strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships across India’s startup ecosystem, including founders, investors, accelerators, and technology communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, success means:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retaining and growing a portfolio of strategic startup users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increasing adoption of relevant Stripe products and use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building senior, trusted relationships that extend beyond a single transaction or renewal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying opportunities early and leading them to a clear commercial outcome&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating a predictable, high-quality operating rhythm across account planning, pipeline management, forecasting, and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping Stripe better understand and serve high-growth companies building from India for the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a commercially strong, intellectually curious account executive who enjoys helping high-growth companies solve important problems. You can move comfortably between a founder conversation, a technical discovery session, a pricing discussion, and an internal strategy review. You are equally comfortable going deep on a small number of strategic opportunities and executing at pace across a broader portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet the minimum requirements, we encourage you to apply. Preferred qualifications are helpful, but they are not required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in account management, consultative sales, customer growth, or another client-facing commercial role, including meaningful experience in the Indian market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated track record of retaining and expanding relationships with technology companies or other complex B2B customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading renewals, upsells, cross-sells, or multi-product commercial negotiations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong discovery skills and the ability to translate business and technical priorities into relevant solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build credibility with founders and senior stakeholders across finance, product, and engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial judgment, including comfort with pricing, business cases, contracts, and competing customer priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical discipline and the ability to use data to prioritize a portfolio, build account strategies, and forecast accurately&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating complex work across multiple internal teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate with ownership and sound judgment in an ambiguous, fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in payments, fintech, SaaS, cloud, developer tools, or financial infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with venture-backed startups, digital-native companies, SaaS businesses, platforms, marketplaces, or businesses expanding internationally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships within India’s founder, venture capital, accelerator, or technology ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with APIs, online payments, subscription business models, fraud prevention, platforms, or cross-border commerce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a global organization with geographically distributed teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with spreadsheets, CRM analytics, SQL, or a demonstrated willingness to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;India’s most ambitious startups are building products for customers across the world. In this role, you will help those companies develop the financial infrastructure they need to scale, while shaping Stripe’s relationships and long-term growth in India. The work combines commercial impact, technical problem-solving, ecosystem building, and the opportunity to partner with some of India’s most exciting founders and technology teams.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Startups, Grower team is a consultative sales team that is responsible for the growth and retention of the largest and fastest-growing Startup customers at Stripe. As an Account Executive, you&#39;ll identify new opportunities for our clients to get the most out of Stripe by understanding our clients&#39; needs, execute scaled sales strategies to close upsells and renewals with existing Stripe customers, and drive end-to-end campaigns to increase adoption of Stripe products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Grower Account Executive on the EMEA Startups team, you’ll drive Stripe’s future growth through account expansion and client retention. You’ll advise businesses on how to optimise their operations using Stripe solutions. You’ll help users understand how Stripe’s modern financial infrastructure supports their growth ambitions and provides a competitive edge for their business or product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Directly manage and cultivate a named list of existing user accounts, while crafting account plans to expand business and retain clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand users’ pain points and Stripe’s value for SaaS platform clients, proposing tailored solutions that support their long-term growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide clients through complex evaluations of Stripe solutions for SaaS platforms, working with cross-functional teams across Product, Risk, and Operations to move new projects through activation and adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategic programs that deepen product adoption and maximise effective utilisation across the current user base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster executive relationships with stakeholders at existing clients to drive retention and identify expansion opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with cross-functional teams on shared initiatives that drive internal efficiency and broader business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Stripe’s go-to-market priority to expand the user base and optimise the renewals motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a curious, well-rounded strategic seller who builds strong relationships with Stripe’s clients in this key segment. You’re comfortable owning your territory and balancing a mix of high-value, strategic deals with smaller, high-velocity deal cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re solution-oriented and adaptable, with an interest in developing yourself and getting things done. You enjoy highly technical sales cycles and working with a diverse group of internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in a client-facing or closing sales role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand complex technical ecosystems and manage complex sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing projects with input from cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build relationships with technical customers, work with a wide range of internal and external stakeholders, contribute to team success, and share knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivation to operate in a highly ambiguous and fluid environment&lt;/li&gt;
