&lt;li&gt;Developer Infrastructure—We&#39;re responsible for the productivity of all developers at Stripe. Ensure Stripe&#39;s engineers have a reliable, fast, and easy-to-use inner dev loop to maximize productivity while building everything from low-latency microservices to large-scale data pipelines and machine learning models.&lt;/li&gt;
