&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Pricing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow revenue, and pursue new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a significant amount of work ahead. This creates an unprecedented opportunity to help expand access to the global economy while doing some of the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deal Pricing is a dedicated global function that provides pricing expertise, financial insights, and deal support for negotiated users across Stripe’s global Go-to-Market (GTM) organization. We help ensure that deals create sustainable economic value for Stripe by establishing commercial frameworks for a scaling sales organization, actively supporting large and strategic opportunities, and delivering pricing insights and recommendations to Sales, Finance, Product, and other cross-functional leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will develop and improve pricing tools used by GTM, Renewals, Deal Pricing, and other teams to evaluate deal economics and support commercial decision-making. Depending on the business need, you may define requirements for systems teams or build offline tools in Google Sheets from the ground up. You will also develop and review pricing dashboards, translate data into actionable insights, and provide recommendations to senior leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Engineering, Product Management, GTM, and Pricing Strategy teams to evaluate pricing strategies, define and test requirements, and support Stripe’s Quote-to-Cash systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute user acceptance testing (UAT) to ensure that system tools meet business requirements and quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build financial models and tools to evaluate the deal economics of Stripe’s payments and software portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze financial and commercial data to identify trends, opportunities, and risks within Stripe’s pricing strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
