&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Finance and Strategy Partner to join our growing team. You&#39;ll help with forecasting, budgeting, and reporting for various departments accurately and in a timely manner and deliver improvements in our integrated financial systems with business partners, financial colleagues, and engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
