&lt;li&gt;Familiarity working with AI APIs and leveraging AI code generation tools to accelerate productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of delivering technical solutions in enterprise environments that drive measurable outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for handling ambiguity and picking up new technologies, frameworks, and tools while working in a variety of client environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Who we are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Stripe&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies, from the world&#39;s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups, use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is building a dedicated Professional Services practice for the world&#39;s leading AI companies. We work with AI labs, infrastructure providers, and application companies that launch quickly, change their business models often, and expand globally early. Their work with Stripe spans products, regions, and technical teams, creating some of our most important implementation challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Integration Engineer, you will work directly with these companies&#39; engineering teams to move complex implementations, migrations, product launches, and international expansions into production. You will also turn what you learn into reusable code, tools, and delivery methods for the wider AI segment.&lt;/p&gt;
