&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery with users, understand their goals and systems, and translate complex use cases into reliable Stripe integration designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build integrations, connectors, migration tooling, automations, and other technical components needed to reach production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an ongoing technical partner to users&#39; engineering teams, explaining Stripe&#39;s products and API architecture while managing dependencies and trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and resolve difficult integration issues by inspecting code, reproducing behavior, testing functionality, and coordinating across Stripe teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead hands-on-keyboard work where appropriate, including proof-of-concept implementations, code reviews, testing strategies, CI/CD guidance, and architecture recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review existing integrations and recommend improvements to reliability, performance, maintainability, and readiness for growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI-assisted engineering and delivery tools to reduce manual work and improve the speed and quality of implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Engineering to identify recurring user needs and opportunities to improve Stripe&#39;s products, APIs, and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create reusable technical assets, including code, reference architectures, migration methods, guides, dashboards, and data analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
