&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Platform Sales team is a highly consultative, enterprise sales team that is responsible for some of Stripe’s largest and fastest growing partners. Stripe helps software platforms offer more value to their customers by embedding Stripe’s powerful payments technology into their solution. As a Platform Sales Manager, you will play a critical role on our go-to-market leadership bench - leading a team of AEs to make payments-as-a-service a competitive advantage for high-growth organizations in the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive sales growth through successful leadership, organizational planning, customer service and outstanding execution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the expansion of Stripe’s footprint with global SaaS platforms in the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make hiring decisions, honing our ideal candidate profile and onboarding strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create structure and focus for GTM ideas and product sales campaigns that the product team is exploring. Drive execution and measurement. Analyze results and make recommendations for action in a timely manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define key sales support mechanisms, processes, and programs to meet the rapid growth of the business and achieve revenue attainment and market development objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a world-class organization and write the playbook for the era of monetizing payments on platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of sophisticated Existing Business, Platform AEs focused on expanding our global footprint with enterprise SaaS platforms in the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive deal strategy and partner across the business to ensure healthy pipeline, funnel conversion, win rate, and margin preservation across the portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively work cross-functionally across the organization to shape Stripe&#39;s product roadmap and drive best practices on selling and forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with the largest strategic opportunities, leading executive relationships&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being accountable for delivering revenue growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8-10+ years of relevant closing sales experience with enterprise customers/large users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of people management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to hire, coach, and motivate a high-performance sales team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to articulate complex, technical concepts and translate them into business-relevant terms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated quantitative and analytical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in fast-paced settings with a high-level of autonomy and can create clarity and structure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A knack for working well with a wide range of stakeholders, both internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scoping and managing strategic projects with input from cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in financial services, the payments industry, or with the card networks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies, from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups, use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Go-to-Market (GTM) Enablement develops the capabilities that help Stripe’s customer-facing teams deliver greater value to users. We define expectations for role excellence, build practical learning experiences, and equip managers to reinforce new skills and behaviors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enablement Business Partners connect our global strategy with the needs of specific regions, segments, roles, and business teams. They partner with leaders to identify performance needs, adapt enablement for the field, and embed learning into everyday coaching and business rhythms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll lead a team of Enablement Business Partners responsible for deploying and adapting enablement across Stripe’s GTM organization. You’ll shape how the team works at scale, including how it prioritizes demand, responds to urgent needs, measures impact, and gives leaders visibility into progress and tradeoffs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll serve as a trusted partner to the Global Head of GTM Enablement and senior GTM leaders. You’ll combine field insights, performance data, and business context to identify needs, guide investments, and help customer-facing teams improve how they serve Stripe’s users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute an Enablement Business Partner strategy aligned with Stripe’s GTM priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a team of Enablement Business Partners, strengthening their capabilities in consulting, stakeholder management, learning delivery, data interpretation, and change leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a consistent intake, prioritization, planning, and escalation model that balances strategic priorities with urgent business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with GTM leaders to identify performance and capability gaps, then translate them into targeted plans for specific regions, segments, and roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the deployment and adaptation of global programs while embedding applied learning, manager coaching, and reinforcement into business rhythms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use conversation intelligence, competency data, learning signals, and business indicators to prioritize investments, evaluate behavior change, and make recommendations to senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build cross-functional partnerships and repeatable processes that clarify ownership, improve execution, and increase the impact of the Enablement Business Partner function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in GTM leadership, sales enablement, sales effectiveness, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing a team in a complex, high-growth organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and scaling enablement programs or business-partner models across multiple regions, segments, or GTM roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building prioritization and operating models, influencing senior stakeholders, and leading complex cross-functional initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using performance data to identify skill gaps, guide coaching, and connect enablement to proficiency, behavior, and business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a quota-carrying sales or sales leadership role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience enabling global teams and adapting programs across regions, markets, and cultural contexts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading organizational change involving sales methodologies, processes, tools, or operating models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using artificial intelligence and automation to improve enablement delivery, personalization, reporting, or operational effectiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Gong or a similar conversation-intelligence platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe builds the most powerful and flexible tools for running an internet business. We handle billions of dollars each year and enable hundreds of thousands of users around the world to scale faster and more efficiently by building their businesses on Stripe. The majority of US internet users have purchased something from a Stripe user in the past year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To further this important mission, we are seeking a Professional Services Manager to lead a team of high-performing Implementation Consultants and Integration Engineers. The Professional Services team partners with Stripe’s largest and most complex users to lead them through the integration process and bring them live on Stripe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Managers at Stripe focus on our largest and most complex users and are responsible for the end-to-end process of scoping, selling, and managing the professional services provided to those users. You’ll inspire &amp;amp; motivate individual development and career growth and develop and execute the long-term strategy and vision of the Professional Services team. You’ll also be tasked with being able to identify, develop, launch, and execute to completion strategic and operational initiatives designed to uplevel the team’s capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee and guide the day-to-day operations of the team, including staffing, metrics, reporting, team management, and engagement sponsorship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as engagement sponsor, ensuring projects are on track; engage with key customer and Stripe contacts as needed to resolve issues and drive progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with other managers and Professional Services teams to optimize team utilization and project coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review pipeline for upcoming projects and manage headcount and staffing accordingly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively source and recruit diverse talent to grow the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Stripe Sales, Customer Success, Technical Account Managers, and Solution Architecture teams to iteratively align with user requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Stripe account teams and Stripe users and prospective users to present the value of professional services; identify, qualify, and scope professional services, and negotiate scope of work between users and Stripe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Stripe Product and Engineering to escalate and develop resolution to issues and incorporate user feedback and requirements into Stripe’s product development cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, capture, and promote best practices, tools, and tactics to enable faster and broader adoption of Stripe products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a collaborative work environment that fosters diversity, autonomy, transparency, innovation and learning while holding a high bar for craftsmanship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience leading and managing client facing Professional Services (or equivalent) teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Account management roles with experience leading technical and implementation resources and scoping/selling professional services to existing and new users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High quality communicator; able to communicate (verbally or written) complex and technical concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to operate in a collaborative cross-functional team environment, providing thought leadership to drive consensus and reach decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and project management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated mentorship capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate and execute in a highly ambiguous, fast-paced dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energy, enthusiasm, and passion for making customers successful and driving individual and team growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with enterprise clients in the Professional Services space at a fast paced technology focused company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world&#39;s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our user base and global footprint grow dramatically, we have unique support problems resulting from both our type of scale and the type of businesses we partner with. The Bangalore Finance (SDC) strategy will provide operational leverage and expand our portfolio of operational capabilities to support the scaled needs for external users and internal Stripe teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining the Finance team will put you amongst some of the most talented finance and operations leaders in the world. We&#39;re looking for a proven leader to build and lead the fast-growing International Accounting team within our Bangalore Finance. The International Accounting Manager for the Controllership function will supervise and evaluate a number of legal entity controllership processes and have experience implementing new systems and tools. This position will suit a person who is a hands-on manager and excited to assist in managing the monthly close, statistical reporting, compliances, coordinating with the board to adopt and approve financial statements, indirect tax filings, cash flow forecasting, intercompany accounting, statutory reporting, consolidation, and audits of all our international subsidiaries and branches. Based in the Bangalore office, you&#39;ll be on the ground floor of this function with an opportunity to set the pace and direction for the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, develop, and lead a team that drives the International Accounting Controllership function based out of Bangalore Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform and drive monthly and quarterly close activities, including manual journal entries, balance sheet reconciliations, variance analyses, and analytical reviews, producing internal management reporting and external audit support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify potential inefficiencies in existing processes and propose improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in building scalable accounting processes, establish measures of success, set benchmarks, and improve timelines and efficiencies to support global growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Billing, Internal Systems, Treasury, Tax, and Legal to investigate issues that arise during reporting cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute internal control documentation and sign-off procedures including the country-prescribed regulatory frameworks (ICFR, SOX, GFS, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance and maintain existing accounting policy and procedural documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive end-to-end improvement of input processes to enable scale and productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, manage, and improve process metrics utilizing automation, lean practices, and process optimization to scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create global best practice documentation and facilitate sharing across the globe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a culture consistent with Stripe Operating and Leadership Principles and a work environment that brings out the best in people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide robust feedback on process health and performance, identifying and remediating errors and delivering scale over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with global process owners and functional leaders to demonstrate strong performance across multiple workflows and set a high bar for consistent improvement over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional projects and reporting that drive performance improvement, visibility, and automation throughout financial services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated knowledge of key business financial metrics, providing metrics inputs to various reporting venues, and communicating key performance indicators to stakeholders in support of business objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced finance operations experience leading large operational processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to set goals and financial plans, and effectively influence leaders across Stripe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to audit, accounting, and risk reviews at a large public accounting firm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12–15+ years of relevant public accounting and industry experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Led accounting teams in a multi-location environment with exposure to multicultural and dynamic business settings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Com and M.Com in Accounting or Finance (Chartered Accountant or CPA strongly preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding and hands-on experience working in US GAAP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and organizational skills, both written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of Excel and experience working with large data sets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience partnering with cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Finance, Accounting, Business, or a STEM field (Science, Technology, Engineering, Math). MBA preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building and scaling new teams from zero&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operational background including new process launch and service delivery in a high-growth technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with written and verbal communications for both technical and non-technical audiences at the senior leadership level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in obtaining, organizing, and analyzing data to challenge conventional wisdom, make fact-based decisions, drive root cause analysis, and evaluate outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Marketing Analytics helps Marketing understand their impact on Stripe and invest in the right opportunities by delivering trusted measurement, actionable guidance, and strategic partnership. It is situated within the broader Data Science organization at Stripe, which is home to a diverse team of analysts, data scientists, and engineers that span their focus across Stripe’s business and products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Manager of the Marketing Analytics team, you will lead and develop a high-performing team of analysts that delivers rigorous analysis, strategic guidance, and trusted data products to Marketing leaders. You will set the team’s strategy in close partnership with Marketing, translating its most important questions and needs into scalable analytical solutions. As a holistic and solutions-oriented leader, you will continually strengthen how the team operates and help your analysts grow. Your team’s work will enable informed investment decisions across the customer journey, from lead generation and acquisition through engagement and retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and drive a roadmap that equips business partners with the data, analyses, and insights needed to articulate Marketing’s impact on the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a player-coach to manage and motivate a team of analysts, partnering with them to go deep in developing expertise in Stripe’s business and Marketing data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a long-term strategy to improve the team’s data and measurement capabilities for use by people and artificial intelligence agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and lead processes and team norms that provide structure, elevate the quality of the team’s work, and enable Marketing Analytics to collaborate effectively across Stripe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a thought leader in areas of agentic automation, data analysis, manipulation, visualization, and storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
