&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of data analytics experience, including 3+ years directly managing Data Analytics or Marketing Analytics teams, and experience building a team, defining its mission, and executing on its goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor’s, Master’s, or Doctoral Degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of cross-functional collaboration, with strong analytical skills to navigate complex decisions and navigate trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL&lt;/li&gt;
