&lt;li&gt;An enthusiastic “roll up your sleeves” mentality, with a bias to action and enjoys “getting things done”, and if questions are unanswered can push forward to find the answers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works well under pressure, with a high degree of adaptability and flexibility in a fast-paced and frequently changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
