&lt;li&gt;Design and build the backend systems that power wallets, identity, and onchain infrastructure at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create platform primitives and APIs that enable teams across Privy and Stripe to build faster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex technical initiatives across architecture, data, and distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the scalability, reliability, and performance of our core platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape our technical direction through high-leverage engineering work&lt;/li&gt;
