&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;must&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; have 5+ years of pre-sales leadership experience&lt;/strong&gt; and&amp;nbsp; 10+ years’ experience in a technical sales role (Solutions Architect/Consultant, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building and leading world-class solution architecture/ engineering&amp;nbsp; teams ideally in a SaaS or usage-based businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Payments experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of how SaaS Platforms operate and monetize their offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
