&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Global Technical enablement team helps Stripe’s user-facing technical teams, partners, and users learn how to build on Stripe and demonstrate their skills. Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://stripe.training&quot;&gt;stripe.training&lt;/a&gt; site complements Stripe’s documentation with structured learning paths, hands-on practice, and technical certifications. We develop applied learning experiences that help people understand Stripe’s products and use them effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
