&lt;li&gt;General software engineering skills are important to us, as we understand that new languages and frameworks can be learned if you understand the concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience teaching or coaching developers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with a great deal of autonomy and limited supervision&lt;/li&gt;
