&lt;li&gt;a good command of written and spoken technical English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And nice to have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;relevant knowledge of design systems (material UI, semantic UI, bootstrap, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;an in-depth understanding of NoSQL DB systems (MongoDB, Elasticsearch, Redis)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
