&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐Our Design team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a team of 115+ designers, researchers, and brand experts led by Chief Design Officer Vuokko Aro. We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone. Product Design makes up almost half of our design disciplines, working in tight-knit squads alongside research, product, and engineering to solve real customer problems at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
