&lt;p&gt;Flex is one of Monzo’s fastest-growing and most commercially significant products. Four years ago, we reinvented the credit card experience—building something simpler, more transparent, and genuinely useful. Today, over a million customers use Flex.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Product Director to lead Flex into its next phase of growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact, deeply commercial role at the intersection of product and credit. You’ll define how we scale borrowing responsibly, expand into new segments, and continue building products customers genuinely love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with Engineering, Credit, Data, Design, and senior leadership to identify new opportunities, optimise performance across complex segments, and deliver at pace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be working on… &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the strategy for Flex&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set direction for one of Monzo’s most important revenue-driving products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and unlock new commercial opportunities across customer segments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate complex trade-offs between growth, risk, and customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive commercial performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Credit teams to shape propositions across multiple risk segments and cohorts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interrogate performance deeply — from unit economics to long-term profitability curves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and drive new commercial opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion the customer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
