&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍London | 💰£53,000 - £68,000 + Incentive Awards tied to your performance + &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our Wealth team⭐&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking to hire a Product Operations Manager to join our Wealth Collective and advance this strategically important area of growth for Monzo. Wealth is already one of Monzo’s largest and most strategically important businesses. The next phase is both challenging and exciting: growing our customer base, expanding into Europe, evolving our product range, and helping customers make better decisions across cash, investments and pensions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;br&gt;🔑 You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Head of Wealth Operations, you’ll be responsible for overseeing day-to-day operations of a Wealth product line (Savings, Investments or Pensions). You’ll also help refine our operations strategy and optimise key processes to help us safely scale our products and features to millions of customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You won&#39;t have a team to run day-to-day; instead you&#39;ll lead through influence, structure and expertise - bringing order to complex, cross-functional planning cycles, taking non-technical delivery work off engineers&#39; plates, and being accountable for the success metrics in your area. You&#39;ll do this across two big strategic bets: going deep in the UK market and expanding our products into Europe, all while we scale to millions more customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be able to leverage our established and award-winning customer service operations whilst also working closely with the Product, Engineering, Partnerships and Risk &amp;amp; Compliance teams to deliver a delightful experience for our users. In time, your remit may also expand to cover other products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement operational strategies to enhance the growth of Monzo&#39;s Wealth business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive high-impact initiatives in your area, defining how we implement compliant, scalable processes that are built for efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate ambiguity to bring structure to complex cross-functional planning cycles — including the operational readiness required for EU market expansion and deeper UK propositions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure efficient, compliant, and seamless delivery of operations, serving as the key contact for escalations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive best practices within the team for all internal operations, both supplier-facing and customer-facing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with product managers, engineers, and designers to enhance product and customer experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor key performance and risk indicators to improve customer experience and operational performance, and manage regulatory compliance with Risk &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee third-party provider effectiveness and collaborate with the Commercial &amp;amp; Partnerships Manager to optimise partnerships and operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ad hoc project manage the implementation of new initiatives, such as supplier integrations, where appropriate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify where digital tools and new technologies can make us more effective, and put them to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for customers - don&#39;t just report feedback, but persuade Product Leads to adjust roadmaps based on qualitative and quantitative trends so we solve the most impactful problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;br&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in designing and managing operations within financial services, banking, or regulated industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in savings, securities, investment operations and/or wealth product, custody operations, transfers, reconciliations, ISA/SIPP administration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working familiarity with the relevant FCA and HMRC rules - e.g. CASS, ISA Regulations, COBS - and comfort operating them day-to-day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching and scaling consumer products and working with third-party providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to drive tangible outcomes, thrive in ambiguity with structured problem-solving, and challenge the status quo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical in developing scalable operational strategies, identifying key metrics to evaluate success, and highly detail-oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative communicator, able to work effectively across functions, levels, and cultures, with clear and persuasive communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast learner who is humble, curious, and enthusiastic about building and scaling new initiatives to reach millions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not ticking every box? That’s totally okay! Studies show that women and people of colour might hesitate to apply unless they meet every single requirement. At Monzo, we’re dedicated to creating a diverse and welcoming team. If you’re passionate about this role and keen to learn and grow with us, we encourage you to apply— even if you don’t have everything that&#39;s listed just yet. Drop us your application, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
