&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Phone call with recruiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial call with hiring manager (30 mins)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical interview with hiring manager and team member (45 mins)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monzo behavioural interview (45 min)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
