&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Staff Engineer Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A Senior Staff Engineer at Monzo is a hands on engineering leadership (IC) position. As a Senior Staff Engineer you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Engineering Directors to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;815&quot; data-end=&quot;876&quot;&gt;shape the technical and product direction of a collective&lt;/strong&gt;, providing leadership across multiple squads (30–70+ engineers) and ensuring alignment with company-wide priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;hands on&lt;/strong&gt; in both coding and architecture, leading from the front.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product and Design leadership to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1698&quot; data-end=&quot;1832&quot;&gt;define strategy, shape roadmaps, and make high-quality trade-offs that maximise business and customer impact across the collective&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2010&quot; data-end=&quot;2079&quot;&gt;Mobilise teams across your collective around high-impact problems&lt;/strong&gt;, creating clarity, alignment and momentum, injecting urgency when needed, or slowing things down to ensure safety and long-term sustainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and influence architectural direction for the most complex systems, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2503&quot; data-end=&quot;2626&quot;&gt;ensuring cohesive, scalable designs across multiple teams and aligning local decisions with the broader system strategy&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and uphold a high bar for technical excellence across the collective, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2882&quot; data-end=&quot;3020&quot;&gt;driving improvements in quality, reliability and scalability, and fostering a culture where engineers hold each other to that standard&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively mentor, sponsor and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3229&quot; data-end=&quot;3276&quot;&gt;develop senior engineers and future leaders&lt;/strong&gt;, multiplying your impact by enabling others to operate at a higher level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be using/ What you’ll be working on:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We rely heavily on the following tools and technologies:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://golang.org/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to write our application code (there’s an excellent interactive Go tutorial&lt;a href=&quot;https://tour.golang.org/welcome/1&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://cassandra.apache.org/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cassandra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for most persistent data storage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://kafka.apache.org/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kafka&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for our asynchronous message queue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://kubernetes.io/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.docker.com/&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Docker&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to schedule and run our services&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://aws.amazon.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for most of our production infrastructure and &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.google.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GCP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for most of our data infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://facebook.github.io/react/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;React&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for internal Web dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://feast.dev/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feast&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for storing our features along a variety of tools to train and deploy models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩We’d love to hear from you if…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lw0ku1&quot; data-start=&quot;527&quot; data-end=&quot;650&quot;&gt;You have a track record of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;556&quot; data-end=&quot;650&quot;&gt;leading complex, high-impact systems and driving technical direction across multiple teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pi33s1&quot; data-start=&quot;651&quot; data-end=&quot;759&quot;&gt;You combine &lt;strong data-start=&quot;665&quot; data-end=&quot;730&quot;&gt;strong technical judgment with product and business awareness&lt;/strong&gt;, making pragmatic trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;127hje3&quot; data-start=&quot;760&quot; data-end=&quot;838&quot;&gt;You’ve worked on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;779&quot; data-end=&quot;838&quot;&gt;scalable backend, distributed or data-intensive systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qezz18&quot; data-start=&quot;839&quot; data-end=&quot;945&quot;&gt;You’re comfortable operating in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;873&quot; data-end=&quot;901&quot;&gt;ambiguous problem spaces&lt;/strong&gt;, helping teams define direction and execute&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;s2puli&quot; data-start=&quot;946&quot; data-end=&quot;1034&quot;&gt;You influence and align &lt;strong data-start=&quot;972&quot; data-end=&quot;1034&quot;&gt;senior stakeholders across engineering, product and beyond&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1s6aorf&quot; data-start=&quot;1035&quot; data-end=&quot;1106&quot;&gt;You care about &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1052&quot; data-end=&quot;1075&quot;&gt;outcomes and impact&lt;/strong&gt;, using data to guide decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cba2y4&quot; data-start=&quot;1107&quot; data-end=&quot;1172&quot;&gt;You enjoy &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1119&quot; data-end=&quot;1172&quot;&gt;mentoring and raising the bar for other engineers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work 💻&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Locations &amp;amp; Flexible Working:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our main tech hub is in London, but our engineers live everywhere in the UK— from Brighton to the Western Isles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value meeting in person but we don&#39;t have a mandated requirement on office attendance, even if you&#39;re nearby. We believe you&#39;ll do your best work if you are where you want to be. If you live outside of London and we ask you to come into the office, Monzo will support you with the costs. ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are naturally social, especially Tuesdays, Wednesdays and Thursdays, which happen to line up with our twice-weekly Monzo lunches &amp;amp; treat Thursdays 🍽️. Teams also schedule time together often for work and play – in or around the office, or online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set up a work schedule that delivers impact and fits your life:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Monzo, we value connections, flexibility, and wellbeing. We keep our meetings during core hours to stay connected and believe in maintaining work/life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be empowered to manage your work in a way that suits you and your team, giving you the freedom for children drop-offs and pick-ups, walking your dog or adventurous cat, avoiding peak commuting times or gym slots, appointments, or supporting your family in an emergency. 🕒✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you prefer to work part-time, we&#39;ll make this happen whenever we can - whether this is to help you meet other commitments or strike a great work-life balance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work the way that works for you with Monzo! 💼&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 Base salary £155,000 - £200,000 + Equity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ We’ll help you relocate to the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✅ We can sponsor your visa.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚£1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏡We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given Macbooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕ Plus lots more! &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Read our full list of benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; The application journey has 4 key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our interview process involves four main stages after an informal recruiter call:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Call&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial Call&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;System Design Interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take home task or pair coding exercise&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final interview including a behavioural and a leadership interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This process should take around 3-4 weeks - your schedule is really important to us, so we promise to be as flexible as possible!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One of our staff engineers has written a detailed blog on their experience through this process, for extra details, hints and tips please see&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/2022/03/23/demystifying-the-backend-engineering-interview-process&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-ZM&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not only about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📍London or Remote (UK) | 💰Competitive base salary and stock options |&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt; Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Monzo, our mission is to make money work for everyone, everywhere. We’re looking for Senior Technical Program Managers to join our Engineering teams across Payments and Business Banking, helping us deliver complex, high-impact programmes as we continue to grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the team you join, you could be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Payments&lt;/strong&gt;: helping us ship more and better payment products, working across teams to solve complex technical challenges and improve how money moves for millions of customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Banking&lt;/strong&gt;: helping us build Monzo into the financial control centre for SMEs. You’ll work across teams to deliver features, services and integrations that make running a business simpler from invoicing and expenses to payments and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Both roles have a wide remit and involve working across engineering, product and other teams at Monzo. We’re looking for people who can bring clarity to complex technical programmes, influence across teams and help turn ambitious ideas into meaningful outcomes for our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end planning and execution of launching payment products that cross multiple teams and disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage cross-collective programs:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define program roadmaps and milestones, set priorities, manage trade-offs, identify and manage critical path and risks, ensure alignment with the business goals and ambition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate and communicate with multiple stakeholders, both technical and non-technical across the business to ensure alignment and speed of delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage dependencies, timeline and sequencing of delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive effective decision making to remove blockers and speed up delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure operational effectiveness across your collective/area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should apply if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 5+ years of experience managing complex technology programs or products from inception to launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to communicate clearly and persuasively to a wide range of audiences, including executive leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable in a global business with a presence in multiple markets and want to be a part of scaling this further&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can work effectively with a diverse range of people and working styles to get stuff done, and are able to thoughtfully and constructively challenge and influence the people you work with&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how functionality comes together (across products and platforms) to deliver value for users, and identify/mitigate delivery risks proactively; can propose and drive a technical solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable personally diving deep into the data and architecture to make good decisions in complex situations where there’s often no “right answer”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The interview process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiter Call (30 mins)&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll meet our Engineering Leadership Recruiter to discuss your experience and learn more about Monzo. They&#39;ll be your partner and guide throughout the interview process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initial Call (45 mins)&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll meet with one of our engineering leaders. They&#39;ll ask you about your previous experience, in particular program execution and technical leadership. They’ll also make time to tell you about Monzo and answer your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Loop Stage (3 hours)&lt;/strong&gt; The Loop stage consists of 3 x 60 min interviews that take place over 1-2 days (depending on your availability).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All things going well, you&#39;ll have completed the hiring process 🚀&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our average process takes around 3-4 weeks but we will always work around your availability. You’ll have the chance to speak to our recruitment team throughout the process. If you’d like to ask a question sooner, email &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:tech-hiring@monzo.com&quot;&gt;tech-hiring@monzo.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰Base salary range for this role is dependent on experience + equity + stock options &amp;amp; benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ We can help you relocate to the UK&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✅ We can sponsor visas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, at times that suit you and your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚Learning budget of £1,000 a year for books, training courses and conferences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕And much more, see our full list of benefits &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-SS1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not only about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍London/Cardiff/UK Remote | 💰£85,000 - £115,000 + Incentive Awards tied to your performance + &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; ✨&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐️ Our Third Party &amp;amp; Outsourcing Risk Management Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a high-performing Global team focused on delivering pragmatic Third Party Risk Management (‘TPRM’) that protects Monzo and our customers globally. As Monzo expands across new markets and scales its product range, the operational footprint is growing fast, and the operating environment is becoming more complex.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Third Party Risk Manager &lt;/strong&gt;to help shape and deliver our approach.&amp;nbsp; As well as ensuring Monzo’s TPRM has well defined controls, processes and governance models in place to meet the continually growing and evolving demands of global Third Party Risk Management regulations - you’ll also set priorities and turn them into measurable improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Director of Third Party Risk, this is a &lt;strong&gt;hands-on &lt;/strong&gt;role, with strategic scope. You’ll work across the global team, and with a variety of stakeholders throughout Monzo, to strengthen our framework, manage complex risks and improve how we deliver TPRM both tactically and strategically.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑 You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivering Core TPRM Operations Globally&lt;/strong&gt;: Operating end-to-end operational activities, including supplier tiering, materiality assessments, due diligence reviews, exit planning support, and regulatory reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Taking ownership of process quality, making sure TPRM activities are completed accurately, consistently and on time. You’ll look for ways to improve how we manage third party risk in practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Helping shape our priorities: &lt;/strong&gt;Identifying emerging risks, gaps and opportunities across third party risk management, and making recommendations to inform the team’s strategy and roadmap. You’ll develop practical solutions and help deliver improvements through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enabling Strategic Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Supporting and feeding into higher-level strategic initiatives and complex risk landscapes. Leading agreed initiatives from problem definition through implementation autonomously, working across teams and global markets to deliver measurable improvements and ensuring clear visibility throughout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborating Across Teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Working directly with internal stakeholders across the 3LOD, and external suppliers to clear blockers, follow up on actions, and resolve issues effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sharing your expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Support colleagues and stakeholders with practical guidance, helping them understand how to deliver their third party risk responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You know Outsourcing, Third Party Risk &amp;amp; Regulation: &lt;/strong&gt;You have substantial practical TPRM experience (ideally in banking or financial services) operating in both the UK and EU financial markets.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ve contributed to a risk strategy, framework or operating model: &lt;/strong&gt;You can demonstrate how you translated an identified gap into a practical improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re comfortable leading complex assessments:&lt;/strong&gt; You make balanced, well-reasoned recommendations when information is incomplete or stakeholders have different priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have experience working with various technologies&lt;/strong&gt;: TPR tooling and AI to build innovative solutions and streamline operational workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You hold a high quality bar:&lt;/strong&gt; You pay close attention to detail and care about accuracy. You use data and reporting to spot patterns, make evidence-based decisions and improve processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You take ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You work independently, take initiative and prioritise your workload in a fast-moving environment. You use sound risk judgement and know when to seek guidance or involve others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You focus on outcomes, not just activity: &lt;/strong&gt;You measure success by what has materially improved whether that&#39;s faster turnaround times, clearer risk ownership, or cleaner supplier data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are a clear, pragmatic communicator: &lt;/strong&gt;You build strong relationships with internal teams, third parties and regulators. You’re comfortable holding colleagues accountable and offering constructive challenges when needed. You bring together input from specialists across Information Security, Data Protection, Legal and Operational Resilience to form a clear view of risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are comfortable escalating: &lt;/strong&gt;You use sound judgement to know when to involve your team or manager in emerging issues or concerns, and communicate your priorities and workload clearly and regularly, defaulting to transparency and taking accountability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 £85,000 - £115,000&amp;nbsp; ➕Incentive Awards tied to your performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 £1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏡 We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given Macbooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕ Plus lots more! &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Read our full list of benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
