&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a proactive and adaptable Account Manager to join our team in Amsterdam. The ideal&amp;nbsp; candidate is a strategic thinker with a hands-on mentality; someone who is eager to help the world’s&amp;nbsp; biggest brands grow while changing an industry. You are excited to work with a global, multicultural team&amp;nbsp; in a collaborative manner and help your team succeed. Your focus will be on delivering an outstanding&amp;nbsp; customer experience, finding new opportunities, and driving mutual success for Adyen and our&amp;nbsp; customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
