&lt;li&gt;Collaboration: As an Account Manager, you will work closely with other Account Managers and collaborate on many different accounts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relationship management: Responsible for ramping and growing customers with a focus on&amp;nbsp; commercial growth, customer satisfaction, and reducing churn.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial acumen: Drive commercial discussions for joint accounts, while striving to meet&amp;nbsp; strategic and financial targets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management: Prioritize and manage short and long term projects with varying timelines&amp;nbsp; across multiple accounts, leveraging internal support teams where relevant.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
