&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research verticals and companies that can benefit from Adyen&#39;s solutions;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, target and reach out to new potential clients for Adyen in alignment with the local commercial strategy;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and deliver outbound campaigns using sales enablement tools to drive top of the funnel opportunities for the business in close alignment with the marketing team;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support sales managers on outbound tactics, lead generation efforts;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and manage the qualification process for inbound leads in Brazil, leveraging Adyen’s global frameworks and ways of working;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the first point of contact for new business prospects and determine the next steps for each prospect moving forward;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a brand ambassador for Adyen at all internal and external company events;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commit to continuous learning on the payments sector and Adyen product offerings.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience selling complex products or services into B2B/enterprise accounts;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Born hunter and networker who find their way in;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work solo as well as being a productive team member, making outbound calls every day;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with modern sales tech stacks, including Salesforce, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, sales engagement platforms, and AI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a strong work ethic with a drive to learn and make new connections with prospects;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong team player who thrives in working in close collaboration with other teams, where you play an integral part in the teams’ success;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English;&lt;/li&gt;
