&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FinCrime Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A key part of building our business is ensuring we do it ethically and sustainably. As a financial institution, we need to know at all times what happens on our platform and whether this aligns with regulations and our risk appetite - and all of this in a scalable way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;FinCrime Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join our FinCrime Operations Department based in Madrid. Do you want to be at the forefront of the fight against financial crime by conducting in-depth investigations and contributing to a passionate team? Then this is the role for you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investigate alerts&lt;/strong&gt; on suspicious transactions, reviewing and resolving daily screening alerts using internal and external systems and databases;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conduct thorough research and risk assessments, &lt;/strong&gt;preparing clear, evidence-based investigations and case narratives in a SAR-ready format to support timely and accurate suspicious activity reporting&lt;strong&gt;;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct &lt;strong&gt;ad-hoc analyses and investigations&lt;/strong&gt; into merchants’ compliance risk profiles;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with global teams&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure consistency and alignment in AML, Screening and Fraud Investigations across all regions;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to team development&lt;/strong&gt; by sharing knowledge and best practices, and assisting in onboarding new team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Propose ideas for improvement&lt;/strong&gt; of our internal processes and workflows;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;1-2 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in AML/CFT compliance and/or AML/Sanctions/Fraud operations, with an emphasis on financial crime investigations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;knowledge of AML/CFT laws and regulations&lt;/strong&gt;, and an intrinsic motivation to follow trends and developments in the AML/Sanctions/Fraud domain(s).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience in the financial sector is a must&lt;/strong&gt;; though experience with payments or fintech is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess &lt;strong&gt;strong analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/strong&gt;, consistently using data to inform your decisions and adopting a solution-oriented approach in all aspects of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are&amp;nbsp;adaptable and able to &lt;strong&gt;handle multiple priorities&lt;/strong&gt; in a dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;excellent communication skills&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;in English&lt;/strong&gt;, both written and verbal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are &lt;strong&gt;naturally curious&lt;/strong&gt;, you have a keen eye for detail, a proactive approach to your work, and a strong drive to understand the “why” behind what you see.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a &lt;strong&gt;continuous improvement mindset&lt;/strong&gt; - you proactively identify inefficiencies, suggest improvements to workflows or tools, and are motivated to help the team and processes evolve as we scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;NB: Contributing to global, impactful and urgent work in AML/Screening/Fraud requires flexibility to rotate workload evenly over the team, sometimes including public holidays and weekends (never more than 5 working days in a week). When this kind of flexibility is required, you will be compensated additionally as per the applicable CBA (i.e. ‘overtime’).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Diversity, Equity and Inclusion commitments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our unique approach is a product of our diverse perspectives. This diversity of backgrounds and cultures is essential in helping us maintain our momentum. Our business and technical challenges are unique, and we need as many different voices as possible to join us in solving them - voices like yours. No matter who you are or where you’re from, we welcome you to be your true self at Adyen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Studies show that women and members of underrepresented communities apply for jobs only if they meet 100% of the qualifications. Does this sound like you? If so, Adyen encourages you to reconsider and apply. We look forward to your application!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s next?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ensuring a smooth and enjoyable candidate experience is critical for us. We aim to get back to you regarding your application within 5 business days. Our interview process tends to take about 4 weeks to complete, but may fluctuate depending on the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.adyen.com/how-we-hire&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Learn more about our hiring process here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Don’t be afraid to let us know if you need more flexibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based out of our Madrid office. We are an office-first company and value in-person collaboration; we do not offer remote-only roles. Relocation and visa support are not available for this position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;English is our working language globally. Please &lt;strong&gt;submit your CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;, as we cannot proceed with your application otherwise.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is Adyen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Adyen provides payments, data, and financial products in a single solution for customers like Meta, Uber, H&amp;amp;M, and Microsoft - making us the financial technology platform of choice. At Adyen, everything we do is engineered for ambition.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For our teams, we create an environment with opportunities for our people to succeed, backed by the culture and support to ensure they are enabled to truly own their careers. We are motivated individuals who tackle unique technical challenges at scale and solve them as a team. Together, we deliver innovative and ethical solutions that help businesses achieve their ambitions faster.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adyen&#39;s growth depends on finding the next verticals where we can win. As (Sr.) Manager, Emerging Verticals, you will explore new industries and turn early hypotheses into clear recommendations on if, where and how we should enter. You will do this by getting close to the market: talking to prospects, partners and industry experts, and working hand in hand with Sales and the regional commercial teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You sit at the intersection of Commercial, Product and Strategy. You will get up to speed on an unfamiliar industry quickly, test what you learn in real customer conversations, and work with Product to understand how well our offering fits. The outcome is a recommendation to leadership (go, no-go, or go later), and for verticals we pursue, an initial value proposition, target segments and pilot approach that the commercial teams can execute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Customer &amp;amp; Market Discovery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speak directly with prospects, partners and industry experts to understand how the industry works, what customers need and how they choose payment providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quickly get to grips with a new vertical: value chain, payment flows, key players, business models and regulatory landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate or kill hypotheses early through real conversations rather than desk research alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Size the opportunity and assess Adyen&#39;s right to win, at the level of depth needed for a good decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Commercial Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Sales, Account Management and regional teams to identify target customers, open doors, run pilots and build early pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join customer meetings and support early deals, bringing industry insight and a clear value story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define target segments, ideal customer profiles and priority use cases that commercial teams can act on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture learnings systematically and share them back with the commercial teams to support enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Product &amp;amp; Offering Fit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Product and Offering teams to assess how well our capabilities fit the vertical and where the gaps are.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the voice of the customer for the new vertical: translate customer pain points into concrete input for product prioritization, pricing and packaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the minimum viable offering and &quot;readiness&quot; criteria needed before we scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; External Consultancy Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the main stakeholder for external consultancies: define scope and hypotheses, manage the relationship and timelines, and quality-check deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decide, together with the Head of Emerging Verticals, when to bring in outside support and when to do the work in-house.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure outside insights are integrated into Adyen&#39;s strategy and passed on to the owning teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Recommendation &amp;amp; Handover&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give leadership clear, decision-ready recommendations on whether and how to enter a vertical, including risks and investment needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hand validated verticals over to a long-term Vertical Head and the commercial teams with a clear strategy, segmentation, GTM approach and learnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a pipeline of future vertical candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in strategy consulting, corporate strategy, business development, venture building or a commercial role, with a track record of getting up to speed in new industries quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Payments, fintech or financial services experience is strongly preferred, ideally in a commercial, strategy or product-facing role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-centric at your core: you enjoy talking to customers, ask good questions and can build credibility with senior stakeholders in an industry you are new to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural partner for commercial teams: you understand how Sales and Account Management work, earn their trust and help them win&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic and hypothesis-driven: you structure ambiguous problems, know when 80% is good enough and can turn what you learn into a clear business case&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to influence without direct authority across Commercial, Product and senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing or working with external consultants or agencies, and the judgment to challenge their output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong storytelling and communication skills, written and verbal, in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial, curious and comfortable operating in a fast-paced environment with no playbook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and availability for frequent domestic and international travel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
