&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This role is based out of our &lt;strong&gt;Chicago&lt;/strong&gt; office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; We&#39;re an office-first company and expect employees to work in-office at least 3 days a week on average. This approach helps strike a balance between bringing people together for in-person collaboration and learning from each other, while also supporting flexibility. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
