&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Head of Regulatory – EMEA&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Adyen is seeking a strategic, high-impact, and visionary regulatory leader to serve as our Head of Regulatory – EMEA.&amp;nbsp;In this role, you will be a senior leader in our Global Regulatory organization - including direct responsible for leading&amp;nbsp;our Regional Counsel teams and Regulatory Strategy &amp;amp; Risk teams across EMEA .&lt;br&gt;Adyen is principally an EU-licensed credit institution with home-state supervision in the Netherlands. As such, Adyen’s regulatory footprint and licensing advantages in Europe form the strategic blueprint for what is possible for our business worldwide. You will lead a high-caliber team of senior regulatory experts who serve as the critical bridge between&amp;nbsp;European supervisory expectations and our &quot;Global-First&quot; regulatory architecture.&amp;nbsp;In this role, you will elevate our financial licensing position as a core differentiator in Adyen&#39;s right to win—transforming&amp;nbsp;regulatory complexity into commercial opportunity and powering sustainable, controlled growth to achieve our ambition&amp;nbsp;as the most customer-focused financial technology platform in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unite &amp;amp; Lead the EMEA Regulatory Function&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
