&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep EU/UK Regulatory Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Comprehensive knowledge of European and UK financial frameworks (PSD2/PSD3, CRD/CRR, EMD, MiCA, DORA, Conduct rules) and credit institution supervisory dynamics. ● &lt;strong&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Pragmatic Architect: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven ability to balance fine regulatory detail with high-level corporate strategy. You possess a track record of transforming regulatory requirements into commercial speed and competitive advantages within the boundaries of risk appetite.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
