&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join Adyen’s Regulatory Function&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As a licensed credit institution operating on its own banking infrastructure across the globe, Adyen’s regulatory&amp;nbsp;positioning is one of our greatest differentiators. Adyen’s Second Line of Defense—comprising Legal, Regulatory,&amp;nbsp;Compliance, Risk, and Internal Control—is entrusted with empowering Adyen’s future by transforming complexity into&amp;nbsp;opportunity and powering sustainable, controlled growth.&amp;nbsp;Leading the EMEA Regulatory function puts you at the absolute heart of Adyen&#39;s global blueprint. Europe is where our&amp;nbsp;core banking permissions are anchored, making your leadership pivotal in setting the benchmark for what is possible for&amp;nbsp;Adyen globally. If you thrive on leading high-performing teams, shaping European regulatory strategy, and driving&amp;nbsp;sustainable innovation for the world&#39;s leading businesses, your voice and leadership will directly shape the future of&lt;br&gt;global commerce.&lt;/p&gt;
