&lt;li&gt;Create a network and be an advisor for the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with your peers from the Internal Control team in managing the global internal control framework and contribute to various projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
