&lt;p&gt;In Chicago the annual base salary range for this role is $160,000 - $230,000.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In New York and San Francisco the annual base salary range for this role is $210,000 - 300,000.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
