&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is Adyen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Adyen provides payments, data, and financial products in a single solution for customers like Meta, Uber, H&amp;amp;M, and Microsoft - making us the financial technology platform of choice. At Adyen, everything we do is engineered for ambition.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For our teams, we create an environment with opportunities for our people to succeed, backed by the culture and support to ensure they are enabled to truly own their careers. We are motivated individuals who tackle unique technical challenges at scale and solve them as a team. Together, we deliver innovative and ethical solutions that help businesses achieve their ambitions faster.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Adyen, our people are our greatest asset, and we believe in giving our team freedom, opportunity, and ownership. As Adyen continues to expand globally, our People Operations team is evolving to ensure our employee experience remains seamless, intuitive, and highly scalable. We are building the next generation of People infrastructure by combining operational mastery with modern AI capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;People Solutions Partner&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team. Sitting firmly within People Operations, this role serves as the functional-technical engine of our operating mode - right at the intersection of people operations and hands-on engineering. You will transform manual workflows into intelligent, tech-forward processes, maximize self-service capabilities across the employee lifecycle, and bridge the gap between daily operations and core HR systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional HR operations/generalist role, nor is it a back-end platform engineering role. Instead, it is an embedded internal product builder role designed for someone who deeply understands employee experience friction and knows how to leverage modern AI tools, low-code automation, agentic workflows, and product design to independently prototype, launch, and scale efficient internal solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit daily People Operations workflows (e.g., onboarding, internal transfers, offboarding) to identify manual friction points. Design, test, and ship specialized AI protocols, automated routing, and self-healing pipelines to eliminate predictable patterns and minimize process exceptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively build, prototype, and deploy solutions independently. Use AI-assisted coding tools (e.g. &quot;vibe coding&quot;, Factory AI), low-code/no-code platforms, and basic scripting (e.g. Google Apps Script) to iterate on internal HR micro-tools, automation scripts, and custom integrations without waiting for dedicated engineering cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure and maintain internal HR knowledge, power automated search, conversational assistants, and triage systems enabling employees and managers to resolve inquiries quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the operational liaison between People Operations and core People Technology teams. Translate business needs into clear technical requirements, workflow maps, and API/webhook integrations across core platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Redesign core lifecycle processes to scale operations. Define and track key efficiency metrics - such as manual hours saved, cycle-time reductions, and self-service adoption - and build automated data pipelines and dashboards to present data-backed proposals for ongoing optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish guardrails around employee data security, privacy, and algorithmic fairness, applying rigorous testing, evaluation, and QA protocols to ensure all AI-driven workflows remain accurate, reliable, compliant, and transparent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable the Team&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Build playbooks, documentation, and enablement frameworks for the broader People team on how to effectively leverage Generative AI, prompt engineering, and low-code tools in their daily work, empowering them to self-serve rather than acting as ongoing technical support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience building, scaling, or optimizing internal platforms at a high-growth global company. Your background might be in &lt;strong&gt;Product Management, People Ops, Business Systems&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Technical Systems Optimization,&lt;/strong&gt; but your track record proves you can build automated, user-centric internal tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;User-Centric &amp;amp; UX/UI Empathy&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; You possess a strong human-centered design mindset. You have experience conducting internal user research, designing intuitive employee-facing interfaces (especially in conversational UI like Slack), and driving change management and user adoption across a global workforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience designing and deploying AI-driven workflows, generative AI models, prompt engineering, and agentic workflows. Comfortable using AI coding assistants, low-code platforms (e.g n8n, zapier), and scripting to parse data and interact with REST APIs and webhooks independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep operational familiarity with core HR platforms (e.g., Workday, Greenhouse, DocuSign, ticketing platforms) from a super-user/administrator perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to break down complex, cross-functional HR processes into structured, event-driven system logic with explicit automated triggers and exception-handling mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent capability to translate complex AI concepts and architectural constraints into clear operational requirements for non-technical business partners and core engineering teams alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial builder mindset who thrives in rapid growth and ambiguity, taking end-to-end ownership to rapidly prototype, test, and scale structured technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Diversity, Equity and Inclusion commitments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our unique approach is a product of our diverse perspectives. This diversity of backgrounds and cultures is essential in helping us maintain our momentum. Our business and technical challenges are unique, and we need as many different voices as possible to join us in solving them - voices like yours. No matter who you are or where you’re from, we welcome you to be your true self at Adyen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Studies show that women and members of underrepresented communities apply for jobs only if they meet 100% of the qualifications. Does this sound like you? If so, Adyen encourages you to reconsider and apply. We look forward to your application!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s next?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ensuring a smooth and enjoyable candidate experience is critical for us. We aim to get back to you regarding your application within 5 business days. Our interview process tends to take about 4 weeks to complete, but may fluctuate depending on the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.adyen.com/how-we-hire&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Learn more about our hiring process here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Don’t be afraid to let us know if you need more flexibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based out of our Singapore office. We are an office-first company and value in-person collaboration; we do not offer remote-only roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is Adyen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Adyen provides payments, data, and financial products in a single solution for customers like Meta, Uber, H&amp;amp;M, and Microsoft - making us the financial technology platform of choice. At Adyen, everything we do is engineered for ambition.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For our teams, we create an environment with opportunities for our people to succeed, backed by the culture and support to ensure they are enabled to truly own their careers. We are motivated individuals who tackle unique technical challenges at scale and solve them as a team. Together, we deliver innovative and ethical solutions that help businesses achieve their ambitions faster.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the People Tech Team at Adyen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Adyen, we believe people are our greatest asset and we want to ensure we deliver the best employee experience globally. People Technology is evolving rapidly from a traditional HRIS function into a high-leverage&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Engineering Engine&lt;/strong&gt;. As part of our &lt;strong&gt;Build HR Technology &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/strong&gt; team, we are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;People Technology Applications Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; based out of our Amsterdam office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will lead the application and integration engineering layer for our People organization. You will design, build, and maintain custom applications, API middleware, automated workflows, and system-to-system integrations across our Workday ecosystem and enterprise tools. You will think beyond individual SaaS platforms to establish scalable application architecture, low-code/custom code solutions, and seamless user experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineer application &amp;amp; integration solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, develop, and maintain custom applications, programmatic API integrations, webhooks, and middleware connecting Workday HCM with Greenhouse, Qualtrics, Docebo, Slack, and internal platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extend platform capabilities:&lt;/strong&gt; Build custom app extensions and tailored UI/UX workflows utilizing Workday Extend, Python frameworks, and modern low-code/no-code platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automate operational friction:&lt;/strong&gt; Follow our &quot;simplify first, then automate&quot; philosophy to eliminate point-to-point manual processes and technical debt. Research, prototype, and deploy automated workflows and custom AI agents (e.g., using Google Vertex AI / Gemini Enterprise). You are curious about emerging technologies (like generative AI and automated agents) and know when they genuinely add business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design for security, privacy, and governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Embed strict access controls, data security, and compliance (GDPR) into all software architectures, ensuring responsible boundaries for handling employee data.&amp;nbsp; You treat security, privacy, and system governance as fundamental engineering requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set engineering standards &amp;amp; documentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish clear software engineering practices, API specifications, and maintainable technical documentation so solutions can be easily supported and scaled.&amp;nbsp; You move comfortably between technical architecture details and broad operational context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner across Product &amp;amp; Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate closely with Core People Tech specialists, Data Engineers, Security, and HR functional leads to translate complex business needs into clean technical solutions. You start with the problem rather than forcing a specific technology, balancing speed with long-term code maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of software development, application engineering, or integration engineering experience in an international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming &amp;amp; API Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong hands-on proficiency in Python (FastAPI/Flask), React, and web technology fundamentals (REST APIs, JSON, Webhooks, OAuth, SQL (Postgre)).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integration &amp;amp; Middleware Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience with integration platforms (iPaaS), event-driven architectures, or middleware tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HRIS &amp;amp; Ecosystem Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience or familiarity with enterprise SaaS platforms (Workday APIs, Workday Extend, Studio, or similar cloud ecosystems).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security-First Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; In-depth knowledge of application security, fine-grained access management, and privacy-by-design principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Mindset &amp;amp; Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent communication skills, strong problem-solving ability, and a drive to challenge requirements constructively to deliver scalable architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success will look like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workday and our broader SaaS ecosystem are connected through reliable, maintainable API integrations rather than brittle point-to-point fixes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Repetitive manual tasks and system friction are systematically eliminated through clean Python automation and custom app extensions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reusable application foundations, middleware, and documentation exist, allowing new People Tech features to be built faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security and privacy boundaries are seamlessly embedded into every deployed application and integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to Shape the Future of People Tech?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy building custom applications, engineering modern integrations, and defining the future of employee experience technology, we invite you to apply and help build our next-generation platform!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Diversity, Equity and Inclusion commitments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our unique approach is a product of our diverse perspectives. This diversity of backgrounds and cultures is essential in helping us maintain our momentum. Our business and technical challenges are unique, and we need as many different voices as possible to join us in solving them - voices like yours. No matter who you are or where you’re from, we welcome you to be your true self at Adyen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Studies show that women and members of underrepresented communities apply for jobs only if they meet 100% of the qualifications. Does this sound like you? If so, Adyen encourages you to reconsider and apply. We look forward to your application!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s next?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ensuring a smooth and enjoyable candidate experience is critical for us. We aim to get back to you regarding your application within 5 business days. Our interview process tends to take about 4 weeks to complete, but may fluctuate depending on the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.adyen.com/how-we-hire&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Learn more about our hiring process here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Don’t be afraid to let us know if you need more flexibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based out of our Amsterdam office. We are an office-first company and value in-person collaboration; we do not offer remote-only roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;This is Adyen&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adyen provides payments, data, and financial products in a single solution for customers like Meta, Uber, H&amp;amp;M, and Microsoft - making us the financial technology platform of choice. At Adyen, everything we do is engineered for ambition.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For our teams, we create an environment with opportunities for our people to succeed, backed by the culture and support to ensure they are enabled to truly own their careers. We are motivated individuals who tackle unique technical challenges at scale and solve them as a team. Together, we deliver innovative and ethical solutions that help businesses achieve their ambitions faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Principal Product Manager, AI-Native Merchant Experiences&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The world&#39;s largest businesses run on Adyen. Payments, financial products, and increasingly the commerce workflows around them — money movement, billing, loyalty — flow through a single platform, across dozens of markets and hundreds of payment methods, at a scale most companies never encounter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That scale comes with complexity, and handling it on our merchants&#39; behalf has always been our mission. But the way people expect to work is changing in real time. The payment operations lead who spent their morning chasing down why a batch of transactions failed now expects to ask a question and get an answer. The analyst who worked a dispute queue case by case now expects the evidence gathered and drafted before they start their work. AI has collapsed the distance between wanting something done and it being done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is where you come in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own the AI assistant that works on a merchant&#39;s behalf across Adyen – one that can find and read their data, provide insights, take real actions, and know where its limits are. You&#39;ll build some of what it can do yourself, and build the foundation that lets teams across Adyen contribute the rest – reporting and insights, disputes, configurations, and everything that follows. And you&#39;ll own how merchants experience these capabilities, as our assistant grows from answering questions to doing the work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By allowing merchants to operate Adyen themselves – accurately, instantly, at any hour – we’ll enable them to go live faster, get more from our platform, and grow, while we in turn unlock growth for Adyen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the vision&lt;/strong&gt; for how merchants will run their business on Adyen through an assistant that works alongside them, and build the multi-quarter strategy that gets us there.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build AI Assistant capabilities.&lt;/strong&gt; Decide what it can do on a merchant&#39;s behalf and how it strings work together – what it should handle on its own, what it should confirm first, and what it should never touch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ship to drive outcomes.&lt;/strong&gt; Take capabilities from idea to production, and drive measurable results for customers and for Adyen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the bar for quality and safety.&lt;/strong&gt; Define what good looks like for merchant-facing agentic capabilities at Adyen, and make it something teams can measure themselves against.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable teams across Adyen to build into your surface.&lt;/strong&gt; Get product teams across domains contributing capabilities to a shared foundation, and guide how it comes together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Galvanize cross-functional teams&lt;/strong&gt; across product, design, engineering, analytics, commercial, marketing, and legal to move with velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go deep with customers and data&lt;/strong&gt; to pressure-test strategic choices and ensure your team is building solutions customers genuinely use and value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Forward Product Sensibility &amp;amp; Experience.&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience shipping AI-native product experiences to real users – LLM-powered, agentic, conversational, or workflow automation. Strong, opinionated intuition for what &quot;great&quot; looks like in this emerging design space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Proven Track Record of Impact.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve built and scaled customer-facing products with material business impact, and you can point to what you personally owned and how you thought about it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Thinking.&lt;/strong&gt; Track record translating customer needs and commercial priorities into multi-quarter product strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrated ability to drive complex programs spanning multiple teams and ship with velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excel in Ambiguity.&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable taking open-ended, undefined business problems and turning them into clear strategy, sequenced roadmaps, and high-velocity execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Set clear metrics and use data to align on priorities, set targets, measure impact, and reset course as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Organizational Leadership.&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to drive adoption of shared capabilities across teams with their own roadmaps and their own priorities, in a high-autonomy, bottom-up culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity On Top of Complexity.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve shipped clear, simple experiences on top of systems that are genuinely complicated — regulated, high-stakes, unforgiving of error. You go deep enough on the domain to earn simplicity, and you don&#39;t pass the complexity on to the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Obsession.&lt;/strong&gt; Passion for deeply understanding the payment operations, finance, support teams, and more at some of the largest businesses in the world, and understanding what they need to excel and get the most out of our products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience building customer-facing products in high-growth tech or fintech environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Total Rewards &amp;amp; Compensation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The annual base salary range for this role is $330,000 - $462,000. Compensation is based on factors including qualifications, experience, and location. Total compensation package includes equity (RSUs), 401(k), health, dental, vision, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;In-office expectations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our San Francisco office. We&#39;re an office-first company and expect employees to work in-office at least 3 days a week on average. This approach helps strike a balance between bringing people together for in-person collaboration and learning from each other, while also supporting flexibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion at Adyen&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We actively seek different perspectives to sharpen our ideas. Our unique culture is a product of our diverse backgrounds and experiences. No matter who you are or where you’re from, you’re welcome to be your true self at Adyen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you need accommodations or support during the recruitment process to perform at your best, you’ll have the opportunity to let our team know in your application. We encourage people from all backgrounds and abilities to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What’s next?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensuring a smooth and enjoyable candidate experience is critical for us. We aim to get back to you regarding your application within 5 business days. Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.adyen.com/faqs&quot;&gt;interview process&lt;/a&gt; tends to take about 4 weeks to complete, but may fluctuate depending on the role. If you have specific time constraints, please communicate them with your recruiter, and we’ll do our best to accommodate them where possible.&lt;/p&gt;
