&lt;p&gt;This is a newly funded team that will working with commercial, operations, and technical delivery stakeholders, you will rapidly prototype and launch solutions - partnering with data and engineering to move at the speed of AI; shipping constantly, iterating on feedback from your internal customers, and pushing the edge of what’s possible with frontier intelligence, agent harnesses, and enabling technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
