&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build High-Impact Internal Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and deliver internal tools and services—such as 360 views of the customer’s integration, proactive performance insights, workflows that manage common tasks and configurations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pioneer AI &amp;amp; Intelligent Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion the adoption of intelligent agents, LLM-powered workflows, and automated triage systems to accelerate the ship, iterate, and scale process of building solutions in an agent-led environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the connective tissue bridging your customer’s needs with the internal data, tooling, and platform teams at Adyen that contain adjacent and relevant capabilities. Partner with them through data contracts, aligning roadmaps, and co-building to deliver solutions that scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Product Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years of product management experience, preferably building internal tooling, technical workflows, and B2B/API products in high-growth software or fintech environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong technical foundation and fluency with modern software architecture, APIs, web technologies, and data pipelines. Passionate about utilizing AI across your product craft and the products you build, with concrete evidence in personal and professional work being hands on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven &amp;amp; Problem Solver:&lt;/strong&gt; You excel at breaking down ambiguous, multi-stakeholder operational problems into structured, scalable solutions. You rely on qualitative user insights and quantitative telemetry to prioritize ruthlessly based on ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User-Centric Empathy:&lt;/strong&gt; High empathy for internal users. You listen intently to commercial and operational teams to understand their daily friction and take pride in delivering software that makes your colleagues more productive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomy &amp;amp; Bias for Action:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive in fast-paced environments where ownership is distributed. You don&#39;t wait for permission; you identify opportunities, build consensus, and drive initiatives to launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent written and verbal communication skills, capable of synthesizing technical complexity into concise narratives for executive leadership, engineering peers, and commercial counterparts across multiple time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formula Fit:&lt;/strong&gt; You embrace the Adyen Formula—you value direct communication, team success over individual ego, long-term durable outcomes, and open collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
