&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is Adyen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adyen is the payments platform of choice for the world&#39;s leading companies, delivering frictionless payments across online, mobile, and in-store channels. Our team members are motivated individuals that help each other do remarkable things every day. We face unique technical challenges at scale and we solve those as a team. And together, we deliver innovative and ethical solutions that transform the way the world pays.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We took an unobvious approach to starting a payments company, building a platform from scratch. Now, Adyen serves the world&#39;s brightest companies like eBay, GoFundMe, Spotify, Uber, Booking, LinkedIn, Wise, Microsoft, Nike, McDonalds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About product experience at Adyen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our product experience organization is a group of full-stack builders who own product discovery and execution end to end, across research, design and content. We bring customers, whether shoppers or businesses, into the center of our product and business decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The problem space&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every transaction Adyen processes is recorded, priced, billed and reported on by the Unified Financial Platform, and every merchant on it is verified and risk-assessed by the same backbone. It brings together accounting, reporting, billing, pricing, reconciliation, configuration, and identity and risk, and every product we ship, from in-store payments to issuing and banking, runs through it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As AI changes what customers expect from financial data, we&#39;re looking for a Product Design Manager to lead the product experience team behind it: someone who still designs, coaches a team of four, and has real influence on the roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a strategic partner to Product, Engineering and senior leadership, defining and driving a product experience strategy that advances business goals and success metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach and grow a team of four full-stack product experience professionals (research, design and content)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay hands-on as a player-coach, contributing to solution discovery and design while raising the quality bar for the team&#39;s work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape how traditional interfaces, AI-assisted experiences and agentic workflows work together around financial data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The areas you will support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Reconciliation:&lt;/strong&gt; self-serve dashboards and data interfaces that streamline how merchants track, report and balance their financial data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue Platform Group:&lt;/strong&gt; end-to-end pricing, billing engines and invoicing tools that manage how Adyen charges and collects revenue globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Accounting &amp;amp; Configuration:&lt;/strong&gt; Adyen&#39;s central ledger and entity structure, ensuring every dollar is tracked in real time for audit and regulatory compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identity &amp;amp; Risk Intelligence:&lt;/strong&gt; verification, KYC/AML and fraud prevention that protect the platform while keeping merchant onboarding smooth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A seasoned manager.&lt;/strong&gt; You have 5+ years of people leadership experience in product design or UX.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strategic leader with a builder&#39;s mindset.&lt;/strong&gt; You use deep craft and business acumen to set a clear vision, empower your team to experiment, and turn that vision into lasting impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A hands-on player-coach.&lt;/strong&gt; You still contribute to discovery and design, and you give your team in-depth feedback on complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A champion for the customer.&lt;/strong&gt; You balance user needs with company goals so solutions have a tangible, positive impact on both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable across functions and levels,&lt;/strong&gt; from engineers to executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A natural coach and mentor.&lt;/strong&gt; People trust your expertise and enjoy working with you. You give clear, constructive feedback that helps your team grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptive and growth-minded.&lt;/strong&gt; You bring curiosity and optimism, embrace change, and drive a culture of urgency where the team moves fast to test, learn and improve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You embody the &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.adyen.com/formula&quot;&gt;Adyen Formula&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with complex B2B or data-heavy products. Payments and fintech experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to AI-assisted or agentic product experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
