&lt;p&gt;Project Operations Managers are responsible for leading the successful execution and delivery of complex payment, platform, and banking rollouts for enterprise customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Project Operations Manager, you will own projects end-to-end — coordinating technical, operational, and commercial stakeholders to ensure customers are successfully launched on Adyen’s platform. You combine strong project management, customer communication, and operational problem-solving skills to navigate complexity and drive execution.&lt;/p&gt;
