&lt;li&gt;Work closely with customer project teams, technical stakeholders, and third-party integration partners to ensure successful rollouts;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with internal and external stakeholders to drive alignment, communication, and project progress;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to team best practices, operational improvements, and knowledge sharing initiatives that improve project delivery across the broader team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to customers by guiding them on Adyen&#39;s products, implementation best practices, rollout strategy, and operational decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify risks, dependencies, and blockers while driving resolution and alignment;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support scalable operational handovers and establish sustainable business-as-usual processes post go-live;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute operational insights and feedback to improve internal processes and project delivery effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
