&lt;p&gt;We are responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building the best and most efficient payment engine globally&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building connections to all relevant payment methods and card schemes (Visa,Mastercard, Amex, etc) worldwide. Removing the complexity for our businesses to integrate them separately. Create a high-available, highly-scalable payment processing platform and connect to hundreds of external APIs. Given our global scale, automating all core processes to match funds to the penny, is a continuous challenge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver an industry leading user experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expand and modernize our portal for our external and internal users. Build a foundation where other solutions can build on top of. You will work on new features for our portal, improving the performance of existing frameworks or building automation APIs which enable platform growth in a scalable way. You will be focusing on providing APIs and UIs to our Merchants to enable self-service.&lt;/p&gt;
