&lt;li&gt;You have experience with Java, web services, REST APIs and SQL / PostgreSQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have worked with and deployed high-throughput and highly reliable services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proactive, you take ownership and you strive for quality, from both a technical and product perspective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent communication skills and you can explain complex, technical concepts to a non-technical audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a team player who knows when and how to involve other people to hear different perspectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know how to evaluate tradeoffs and how to balance speed vs tech debt&lt;/li&gt;
