&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Procurement Manager - Data Centers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a fast learner and hands-on Procurement Manager to join Adyen&#39;s Procurement team, a dynamic global team within our Finance function. The goal of the team is to contribute to Adyen’s 10x ambition through sustainable commercial decisions, risk mitigation, contract and vendor management, ultimately empowering stakeholders to deliver their strategies. You will work in the data center category, alongside another category manager and a supply chain manager, but as Adyen grows, and the Procurement team with it, this scope might change and increase in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
