&lt;h3&gt;Senior Product Manager, Capital&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a massive opportunity ahead of us – to scale Adyen’s financial products by 10x, ushering in the next phase of growth for the company. Adyen has built a Financial OS spanning Capital, Banking, and Issuing, powered by our unified global platform, banking licenses, and dynamic identity data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;em&gt;Senior Product Manager&lt;/em&gt; to help scale &lt;em&gt;Capital&lt;/em&gt;, which will be foundational for Adyen’s next generation Financial Products. The Capital team is on a mission to enable businesses to grow &amp;amp; thrive by providing them innovative financing solutions. The role is based out of San Francisco&amp;nbsp; and sits within the Capital team, which is part of our Financial Services product team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Successful candidates will have demonstrated passion for financial technology and are excited about Adyen’s opportunity to build a meaningful Capital business in the next 2-5 yrs. In this role, you will be responsible for building a roadmap and executing on new financing products. You will collaborate closely with our Product, Commercial, Design, Engineering, Finance, Operations, Regulatory, and Compliance teams to deliver customer and business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set strategy and roadmap for new Capital products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand customer needs and make investments in products and features that deliver customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead platform-scale execution working closely with the Engineering, Product, Design, Finance, Operations, Regulatory, and Compliance teams to deliver a highly automated platform that scales globally without compromising reliability or trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate with a data and experimentation first mindset&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;defining success metrics for the team and adopting an AI-first product development approach that uses experimentation to measurably improve outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience building high-scale products in fast growing tech or fintech environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in lending, banking, or adjacent products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of delivering complex product and platform initiatives at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in ambiguity with high autonomy and ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
