&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Products&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adyen is expanding beyond payments by building an entire suite of embedded financial services tailored for platforms, marketplaces, SaaS businesses, on-demand platforms, and crowdfunding platforms. Our team’s mission is to enable these platforms to manage their global payments and financial services seamlessly through API integrations or hosted solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our solutions, platforms can:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run onboarding, verification, and compliance processes across multiple markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage payments and trigger faster payouts and bank transfers in all preferred currencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offer value-added services like capital lending and the issuing of payment cards and bank accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team is responsible for developing the technology behind this unified platform, focused on several different areas.&lt;/p&gt;
