&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will possess a deep, comprehensive understanding of how these firms operate, win, and deliver transformation services. You are comfortable streamlining team operations, encouraging effective cross-functional and cross-continental collaboration, and confidently engaging with senior executives both internally and throughout our partner ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
