&lt;li&gt;Serve as a senior stakeholder, providing strategic and consultative advice to influence and fulfill the global payments strategy of our platform customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear individual and team goals focused on revenue growth. Report on performance and metrics at an executive level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an inspiring and collaborative team environment with an open communication/feedback culture.&lt;/li&gt;
