&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Lead - Support Complaints&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Adyen, speed and scale must go hand-in-hand with unwavering trust, compliance, and regulatory rigor. We are looking for a decisive, high-conviction Team Lead, Complaints &amp;amp; Non-Merchant Operations to build, mature, and lead a dedicated team within our global Operational Support organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will lead a team of 5–10 specialists handling high-stakes, time-sensitive non-merchant workflows – including customer and third-party complaints, external authority and law enforcement inquiries, complex escalations, and more. You won’t just be managing a queue; you will own the evolution of this function from an initial framework into an audit-ready, industry-leading operational engine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will serve as the primary operational partner to teams like Financial Crime, KYC (Know Your Customer) Operations, Legal, and Privacy, establishing clear boundaries, setting robust SLAs, and presenting our controls directly to senior leadership and auditors. If you thrive in high-autonomy environments, make sound decisions under pressure, and love turning complex, ambiguous challenges into scalable processes, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Organizational Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary operational leader within first line support and point of contact for internal partner teams, including &lt;strong&gt;FinCrime (Fraud/AML), KYC Operations, Legal, Data Privacy, and Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear operational scope, intake and identification protocols, and SLAs with cross-functional partners, as well as set and enforce procedure and standards&amp;nbsp; across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead recurring cross-functional alignment and manage reporting governance to address process bottlenecks, refine ticket handoffs, and align on evolving regulatory guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Complaints Working Group - compile and report on metrics, improvements, and gaps to senior leadership in first and second line&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Executive Visibility &amp;amp; Audit Readiness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the Complaints &amp;amp; Non-Merchant Ops function to senior leadership, presenting operational health, volume trends, SLA compliance, and emerging risk patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
